<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">MARIKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vhangeri Ridonyohwa naMariko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kuwidzira Vhangeri Ridonyohwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">naMARIKO</para>
  <para style="ip">Vhangeri ridonyohwa naMariko ndimwe romabhuku manai muChibvumirano Chitsva yanotsanangura upenyu hwaJesu Khirisitu. Rimwe norimwe rinodaidziwa kuti “vhangeri,” zvinoreva kuti “Nyaya Idonaka.” Mumasure mokupfa kwaJesu Mateo, Mariko, Ruka naJohwani ndivo vadodzonyora mabhuku yakareya. Vhangeri ridonyohwa naMariko ndiro ridopfupikitsa pamavhangeri yakareya yese yari manai. Zvinotendewawo kuti Mariko ndiro bhuku ridothangira mavhangeri yese kunyohwa. Ridonyohwa pakati pomakore 65 kusvika 70 mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. Ana mazvikokota vodzidzo vazinji vanotenda kuti ridonyorehwa kuRoma nochinangwa chokukurudzira maKhirisitu vaikoko kuRoma.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mariko uyo anozikana achiitiwa Johwani Mariko, waifamba noNhumwa Phauro naBhanabhasi, asi adodzonga unhu hwache paadovasiya pahwendo hwavo hwokoparidza (Mabasa 13:13). Pasure Mariko adodzofamba kamu naBhanabhasi (Mabasa 15:37-39). Mariko waizikanawo ari shamwari yopamwoyo yaPita (1 Pita 5:13) Kana zvazvene Mariko wanga asiri pfakazi idoona zvoupenyu hwaJesu, ana mazvikokota vodzidzo vanotenda kuti adonyora zvidowanda zvoupfakazi hwaPita panova ipo padotsamira Vhangeri ridonyohwa naMariko. MuVhangeri rakareri, Mariko anonangana nozvoudzidzi futi nodzidziso dzaJesu dzonguwa yokupedzisira.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mariko anowidzira bhuku muchitsauko chokuthanga (Mariko 1:1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Zvino Mariko anodzotsanangura ushumiri hwaJesu paanga ari muGaririya muchitsauko (Mariko 1:14—8:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Chinotevera, anotaura zvourendo hwaJesu kuJerusarema (Mariko 8:22—10:52).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Mariko anopedzisa nokunyora pamusoro ponguwa yaJesu muJerusarema, kuverengera ipfa nokumuka kwache (Mariko 11:1—16:8)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Kuparidza kwaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Ruka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Johwani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Aya ndiyo mathangiro yoNyaya Dzidonaka dzaJesu Khirisitu, Mwanakomana waMwari. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa nomuporofiti Isaya achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Ona, ‘ndinotuma nhume yangu pamberi pako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">achanhadzira nzira yako.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Izvi roanokuwa musango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘nhadzirai mugwagwa waIshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">yororai nzira dzache!’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Johwani Muombeki adooneka musango achiparidza ruombeko rokupinduka kuti vanhu varegerehwe zvitema. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Vanhu vazinji vadosvokonoka kuenda kwaari vese vomunyika yoJudhiya novanhu vese vomuJerusarema, vadoombekewa naye muhwizi roJorodhani, vachireurira zvitadzo zvavo.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Zvokusimira zvaJohwani zvanga zviri zvoukuse hwongamera, pakamu wanga anobhande rochikumba muchiuno chache. Zvokuja zvache zvanga zviri mabombo nouchi hwomusango. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Iye adoparidza achiti, “Pano mukurufutiyo anokunda inini ari kuuya kumasure kwangu, inini ndinokodzeraba kukotama ndichisugudura murau woshangu dzache. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ndakuombekai nomvura asi iye achakuombekai noMweya Mutsvene.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuombekewa noKuedzewa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mateo 3:13—4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Ruka 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mumazuva yakareyo Jesu adouya achibva kuNazareta mudunhu roGaririya achibva waombekewa naJohwani muJorodhani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Jesu paadobirika mumvura, kabodzi nokabodzi adoona denga razururiwa futi Mweya achiburukira paari adoita kunge njiva. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Zvino izvi ridobva kudenga ndokuti, “Ndiwe Mwanakomana wangu wandinoditsa, iwepa unondifadza zvidonyanya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Nokamangu Mweya adomuendesa kusango, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />kwaadogara mazuva makumi manai, achiedzewa naSathani, nozvirombo zvomusango zvanga zviri kwakareko, futi ngirozi dzidomushandira.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodaidza Vabati Vohove Vanai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mateo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Ruka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Zvino mumasure mokusungiwa kwaJohwani, Jesu adoenda kuGaririya koparidza Nyaya Idonaka yaMwari. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Jesu adoti, “Nguwa yazazisiwa, futi umambo hwaMwari hwava papfupi! Pindukai kubva muzvitema zvenyu mutende Nyaya Idonaka!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Paanga achifamba nomunyasi mogungwa roGaririya, adoona Simoni naAndireya vaiva mukoma nomunin'ina vachikhandira mambure yavo mugungwa, ndava vaiva vabati vohove. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Nditeverei, ndikuitei varauri vovanhu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Nokamangu vadosiirafuti mambure yavo, ndokumutevera.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Paadondotekaira pashoma, adoona Jakobho mwanakomana waZebhedhiya, naJohwani waiva mukoma nomunin'ina’ina naye, vaiva mukamwadiya vachinhadziridza mambure yavo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Nokamangu adovadaidza, vadobva vasiya baba vavo Zebhedhiya vari mukamwadiya pabodzi novashandi ivo ndokutevera Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murume wanga anoMweya Udoipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Ruka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Zvino vadoenda kuKaperenaume, nomusi woSabata adopinda musinagoge nokamangu ndokuvadzidzisa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ivo vadoshamisika nomadzidzisiro yache, ndava adovadzidzisa semunhu anochikuriri, asingaite kunge vanyori.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Pasinai nonhambwe yese musinagogemo manga muno munhu waiva nomweya udoipa, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />iye adokuwa achiti, “Munei nesu, Jesu woNazareta? Mauya kudzotiparadza chere? Ndinokuzivai kuti muri Mutsvene waMwari.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Asi Jesu adomudzuma achiti, “Nyarara, ubirike maari!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mweya udoipa udodzutsa munhu wakareyo zvinosimba, uchikuwa noruzha, ndokubva wabirika maari. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Vese vadoshamisiwa nazvo ndokuthanga kubvunzana vachiti, “Anga chiiko ichochi? Ikoku kudzidzisa kutsva chere? Anotodzuma nosimba mweya idoipa, iyo ichimuteerera!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Nokamangu nhau pamusoro pache dzidopararira muGaririya rese.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Vanhu Vazinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Ruka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Nokamangu adobirika musinagoge, ndokupinda mumba maSimoni naAndireya, pabodzi naJakobho naJohwani. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Zvino amezvara vaSimoni vanga vachihwara nomuviri vadotoenzera, nokamangu, vadonyepa Jesu pamusoro pavo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Iye adosvika, ndokuvabata ruoko achivamutsa. Pakarepo muviri udopora, vachibva vavatenairira.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Mauro yakareyo zuva rakunyura ratoti piriviri, vadouya kwaari novese vanga vachihwara novadogahwa nomashave. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Gurusvusvu rovanhu ridoungana pamusuwo richibva munzvimbo dzese dzoguta. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Iye adoporesa vahwere vadowanda vanga vanomatenda yadosiyana siyana nokudzinga mashave mazinji. Adorambidza mashave kunyaira, ndava yaimuziva kuti mbani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoparidza muGaririya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Ruka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mambakwedza, kuchidosvipa, Jesu adomuka ndokubirika. Adoenda kwache wega, konamata. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni naabiyake vadoenda kumutsvaga, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />pavadomuwana, vadoti kwaari, “Vanhu vese vari kukutsvagai.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Mbatiendei kunoyamwe maguta. Ndinofanira ndiparidzewo kwakareko, nokuti ndizvo zvandidovinga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Nokudaro adofamba muGaririya rese, achiparidza mumasinagoge yavo nokudzinga mashave.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murume Anoporesewa naJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Ruka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Munhu wanga anomabobo adouya kuna Jesu, ndokupfugama, achimuteterera achiti, “Kana muchida munogona kundinatsa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jesu adomunzvira tsitsi, ndokutambanudza ruoko rache achimubata. Adoti kwaari, “Ndinoda, chinatsiwa.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Kabodzi nokabodzi mabobo yadobirika kwaari, achibva wapora. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Zvino Jesu adomutsindikira ndokumunyepa kuti aende zvache, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Adoti kwaari, “Ona kuti hapanai waunozvinyepa. Asi enda kozvinangidza kumuphirisita, wopereka chibairo chokunatsiwa kwako sezvidoraihwa naMozisi kuti chive upfakazi kuvanhu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Asi paadobirika kuenda, adothanga kuzvitaura taura, achiparadzira nhau yakareyo, zvokuti Jesu haanai kudzogona kupinda muguta zviri pachenu, asi adogara kunze munzvimbo dzache wega. Asi vanhu vadoramba vachiuya kwaari vachibva kwese kwese.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume Adotonhora Nhengo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Ruka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Kwapera mazuva mashoma adounza pakamu kuKaperenaume. Vanhu vadonzva kuti ari pamumba. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Vadoungana vadowanditsa zvokutadza kukwana mumba, vadotadza kukwana nopachivanze, iye adovaparidzira Shoko. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Zvino varume vanai vadouya kwaari vadotembedzana murume wanga adotonhora nhengo. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Pavadotadza kusvika papfupi naye nokuda kwomhomho yovanhu, vadonyandanura denga roimba yakareyo panga padonangana naJesu. Vadobva vadzikisa mukhangara waiva nomuhwere wavo. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Jesu paadoona kutenda kwavo, adoti kuno adotonhora nhengo, “Mwanakomana wangu, zvitema zvako zvaregerehwa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Zvino vamwe vanyori vanga vadogarikika makaremo vadonyairira mumwoyo yavo vachiti, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Seiko munhu wakareyu achinyaira zvidodai? Nghutoshora Mwari kwakareku! NdiMwari basi anokona kuregerera zvitadzo peno!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Pakarepo Jesu adobva wazivirafuti mumweya mache kuti vari kufunga zvakarezvi mumwoyo yavo, adobva wati kwavari, “Muri kufungireiko zvidodarozvo mumwoyo menyu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Nzvipi zvidopusa kuti kumurume adotonhora nhengo, ‘Zvitema zvako zvaregerehwa,’ kana kuti, ‘Sumuka, tora bonde rako, utekaire?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Manje kuti muzive kuti Mwanakomana woMunhu anomasimba panyika yokuregerera zvitema,” adoti kumurume adotonhora nhengo, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Ndinoti kwauri, sumuka, tora bonde rako uende kumba kwako!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Adosumuka ndokuhwengeratu bonde rache achibirika vadomunangara vese. Vese vadoshamisika ndokurumbidza Mwari vachiti, “Zvidodaizvi hatinati tazviona.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodaidza Revhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Ruka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Jesu adobirika pakare achienda panyasi pogungwa roGaririya, vanhu vadoungana kwaari, iye ndokuvadzidzisa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Achitekaira daipo, adoona Revhi, mwanakomana waArufiyasi, anozita rokuti Mateo, wanga adogarikika paimba yomutero. Jesu adoti kwaari, “Nditevere.” Iye adosumuka ndokumutevera.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Zvino paadogarikika kuti aje pathafura mumba maMateo, vateresi vazinji novatadzi vadogarawo pabodzi naJesu novadzidzi vache, ndava vaimutevera vanga vari vazinji. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Zvino vanyori vovaFarisi, pavadoona kuti ari kuja novateresi novatadzi vadoti, kuvadzidzi vache, “Anga indava yei achija novateresi novatadzi?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Zvino Jesu paadozvinzva adoti kwavari, “Vapuma vanodaba chiremba, asi vanohwara ndivo vanoda chiremba. Ndidouyaba kudzodaidza vadorurama, asi vatadzi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo pamusoro Pokutsanya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Ruka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Vadzidzi vaJohwani novaFarisi vaitsanya. Zvino vamwe vanhu vadouya kwaari vachiti, “Anga indava yei vadzidzi vaJohwani novadzidzi vovaFarisi vachitsanya, asi vadzidzi venyu vasingatsanyewo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Anga vadokokewa kumuchato vangatsanye chere mukwende ari pakati pavo? Kana mukwende ari pakati pavo vanotsanyaba. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Mazuva yachasvika pachabiritsiwa mukwende kubva kwavari, ipopo ndipo pavachadzotsanya.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Hapanai anosonerera chigamba chitsva pabiza rokare, akaita zvakarezvo chigambacho chinomwaura biza, boo ronyanyitsa kukura. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Hapanai anoisa waini itsva muhomwe yodehwe rokare. Akaita zvakarezvo waini itsva inophabura homwe yodehwe, waini yotaika nohomweyo yoparara. Asi waini itsva inoisiwa muhomwe yodehwe ritsva.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubvunzo pamusoro poSabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Ruka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Noumwe musi woSabata Jesu adopinda nopakati pominda yogorosi. Pavaitekaira daipo, vadzidzi vache vadothanga kuchora hora dzogorosi. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Ipopo vaFarisi vadoti kuna Jesu, “Sei vachiita zvisingatendehwe kuitiwa paSabata?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Hamunai kuverenga nai zvidoitiwa naDhavhiti paanga waanonzara iye novanhu vaanga anavo? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Adopinda mumba maMwari pamazuva yomukuru wovaphirisita Abhiyata, achija mazingwa yanoyera. Mazingwayo yanga yasingabvumihwi kujiwa noumwe munhu kusiya kwokujiwa novaphirisita basi. Adopasawo vanhu vaanga anavo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Jesu adoti, “Sabata idoitihwa kuti ibatsire munhu, aikona kuti munhu abatsire Sabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Saka Mwanakomana woMunhu ndiShe woSabata pakare.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Murume anga ano Ruoko Rudoputana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Ruka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Jesu adopinda kamu musinagoge, makaremo manga muno munhu ano ruoko rudoputana. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Vadomunangara kuti vaone kana waidzomuporesa nomusi woSabata, kuti vawane mhosva yokudzomunenedzera. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Ipopo adoti kumurume wanga anoruoko ridoputana, “Uya pano.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ndokubva wadzovabvunza achiti, “Zvinobvumihwa chere kukohorora kana kudzonga, kuchidza kana kubaya nomusi woSabata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Asi vadoramba vadonyarara. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Adovanangaranangara noukari, achishushikana zvidonyanya nondava yokuoma mwoyo kwavo, adodzoti kumunhu wanga adoremara, “Tambanudza ruoko rako.” Iye adoritambanudza, ndokubva rapora. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Pakarepo vaFarisi vadobirikirafuti vachienda korangana novobato raHerudhe, mabairo yavaidzoita Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gurusvusvu Panyasi poGungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jesu adobirika novadzidzi vache ndokuenda kugungwa, adobva watevehwa nogurusvusvu rikuru rovanhu. Vanhu vakarevo vadobva muGaririya, nomuJudhiya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />nomuJerusarema, nomudunhu roIdhumiya, novadobva kumhiri kwoJorodhani, novaibva kudopoteredza Tire noSidhoni. Gurusvusvu rikuru ridonzva zvese zvaadoita ridouya kwaari. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Nokudaro adoudza vadzidzi vache kuti kuve nokamwadiya, kokudzopinda kuti vanhu vareke kudzomusvanikidza. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Nokuti wanga waporesa vahwere vazinji, zvokuti vese vanga vachihwara vadotsvekenyedza vachivavarira kuti vandomubata. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Pese paaionewa novanhu vadogahwa nomweya idoipa yaiwira pasi pamberi pache ichikuwa ichiti, “Ndimi Mwanakomana waMwari!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Asi Iye waiirambidza zvidosimba kuti ireke kuzivisa vanhu kuti Iye mbani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anosarudza nhumwa Gumi Novairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Ruka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Zvino adokwira mugomo ndokudaidza vanhu vaaida. Ivo vadouya kwaari. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ipopo adosarudza gumi novairi vaadoda ndokuvatenza kuti nhumwa, kuti vave naye achivatuma koparidza. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Kuti vave nomasimba yokudzinga mweya idoipa.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Simoni waadodzotenza kuti Pita, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />naJakobho waiva mukoma nomunin'ina’ina naJohwani vanakomana vaZebhedhiya, vaadodzoshinjirira kuti Bhonagesi, zvinoreva kuti vanakomana vokudhirima, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />naAndireya, naFiripi, naBhatoromiyu, naMateo, naTomasi, naJakobho mwanakomana waArufiyasi, naThedhiyasi, naSimoni woushingi, muKhenani, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />naJudhasi Sikariyoti wokudzomupandukira. Pasure adodzoenda kumba.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu naZerubhabhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Ruka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Zvino gurusvusvu ridoungana kamu, zvokuti vadotosaya nguwa yokuja. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Hama dzache padzidozvinzva dzidoenda dzichida kumutora nokuti vanhu vanga vaakutonyaira vachiti, “Waakupenga!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Ukuwo vanyori vanga vabva kuJerusarema vaiti, “Adogahwa naZerubhabhu, jinda rikuru romweya idoipa, ndiro raanodzinga naro mashave.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Ipopo Jesu adovadaidza ndokutaura navo nomufananidzo achiti, “Anga Sathani angadzinge tini Sathani? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Umambo hukazvipandukira huchizvihwisa hwega hunopfuruka peno. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kana mhuri ikazvipesanisa inodzokonaba kumira; <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />naSathaniwo akazvipandukira, wazviparadzanisa wega anenge achakonaba kumira, wapfuruka.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Hapanai munhu angapinde muimba yomunhu ano simba kuti atore zvidziyo zvache kana asati wasunga nyamasimbayo, ipopo ndipo paanodzokona kupamba zviri mumba mache.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri vana vovanhu vanogona kuregerehwa zvitema zvese, kana nokutoshora Mwari chaiko. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Asi anoshora Mweya Mutsvene haarekerehwe, ndava wava nomhosva yochitadzo chokusingapere. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Adodaro ndava vanga vamuti ano mweya udoipa.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amai novanin'ina’ina vaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Ruka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ipopo amaache novanin'ina’ina vache vadosvika. Vadomira panze, vadomira daipo vadotuma munhu komudaidza. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Zvino mhomho yanga idogarikika naye mumba, idomunyepa ichiti, “Amai venyu novanin'ina venyu vari panze, vari kuda kukuonai.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Iye adovapindura achiti, “Amaangu mbani? Vanin'ina vangu mbani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Adonangara nangara vanhu vanga vadogarikika makaremo, ndokubva wati, “Vakareva ndivo amaangu novanin'ina vangu! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Wese anoita zvinodiwa naMwari, ndiye nomunin'ina wangu, nohanzvadzi yangu, namaangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMujari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Ruka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Adothanga kudzidzisa pakamu ari pamhera pogungwa. Gurusvusvu rikurufutiro ridomuunganira zvokutoti adodzopinda mukamwadiya kanga kari mugungwa ndokugarikika makaremo. Gurusvusvu rese ranga riri kumhera kwogungwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Adovadzidzisa zvidowanda nomifananidzo.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />Adoti kwavari, “Tetekerai, mujari adoenda kojara mbeu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Achijara daipo dzimwe dzidombwerera munzira, tushiri tudouya ndokudzija. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Dzimwe dzidombwerera pamabhwe, padzidosaya ivhu ridowanda. Nokuti ivhu ranga riri rishoma, dzidobva dzamera nokamangu. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Zvino zuva paridobirika, dzidotsva, nokuti midzi yadzene yanga isinai kudzika pasi, dzidouna ndokuoma. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Dzimwe mbeu dzidombwerera panga pano mwinza, mwinza idokura ndokudzivhinga, dzichibva dzatadza kuita zvibereko. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Dzimwe mbeu dzidombwerera paivhu ridonaka, dzidokura ndokubereka zvibereko zvidowanda, zvimwe zvidopetewa makumi matatu, zvimwe zvidopetewa makumi matanhatu, zvimwewo zvidopetewa kazana.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Adodzoti kwavari, “Anonzeve mbaatetekere anzve!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinangwa choMifananidzo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Ruka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Paanga ava wega, vaye vaanga anaye pabodzi novanogumi novairi vadomubvunza pamusoro pomifananidzo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Adoti kwavari, “Imimi mudopasiwa zvidohwanda zvoumambo hwaMwari. Asi kuno vokunze, zvese zviri mumifananidzo, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kuitira kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘vaone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">asi vasingaonetsetse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">futi kuti vanzve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">asi vasinganzvitsitse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Zvidoitihwa kuti vareke kupinduka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">vachidzoregerehwa.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotsanangura Mufananidzo woMujari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Ruka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Jesu adodzoti kwavari, “Hamunzvitsitse mufananidzo wakareyu nai? Anga zvino mimwe yese munodzoinzvitsitsa tini? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mujari anojara shoko. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Mbeu idombwerera munzira, mbaye vanoti kana vanzva shoko, Sathani anouya nokamangu achivatorera shoko rajariwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Mbeu idombwerera pamabhwe mbaye vanoti vakanzva shoko, vanoritambira nokamangu nomufaro. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Asi havanai midzi, vanondotsungirira kwokanguwa kapfupi. Panouya nhamu kana kutambudziwa nokuda kwoshoko, vanowa nokamangu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Dzidombwerera paminzva mbaye vanoti kana vanzva shoko, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />asi kuda zvonyika nokufarira upfumi nokuda zvimwewo zvinhu zvinopinda zvovhunga shoko, rotadza kuva nozvibereko. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Asi mbeu dzidombwerera paivhu ridonaka mbaye vanonzva shoko voritambira vobereka zvibereko, zvimwe zvidopetewa makumi matatu, zvimwe makumi matanhatu, zvimwe zana.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwenje Panzvimbo Yawene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Ruka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Futi adoti kwavari, “Mwenje unobatidziwa uchiisiwa pasi potsvanda kana kuti pasi pomubhedha usingaisiwe pachigadziko chawene chere? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Nokuti hapanai chidosvisviwa chisingadzoisiwa pachenu, kana chidohwanziwa chisingadzozikana. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Anonzeve mbaatetekere anzve!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Futi adoti kwavari, “Chenjererai zvamunonzva! Mhimo yamunopima nayo ndiyo ichava mhimo yamuchapimihwawo, futi ichaingidzihwa kamu. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Nokuti kuno anazvo achapasiwa zvidowanda, asi asinai nochaanofungacho kuti anacho achatorehwa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo woMbeu Inokura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Adovanyairira kamu achiti, “Umambo hwokudenga hudofanana nomunhu adojara mbeu mumunda, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Iye anoenzera usiku, masikati achimuka, uku mbeu inomera ichimbondokura asinganzvitsitse kuti zvinoitika tini. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Nokuti ivhu rinoberekesa rega mbeu, chinotanga mukuyo, kwotevera mimba pagunje, pakupedzisira poita pfunde pahora. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Panondoibva mapfunde yakareyo murimi anopinda nochipanga achicheka nokuti kukohwa kwasvika.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Wombeu yomasitadhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mateo 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Ruka 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Zvino adoti, “Chiiko chatingafananidze nacho Umambo hwaMwari? Tingahuti hudofanana nochii? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Hudoita kunge mbeu yomasitadhi inojariwa iri idikidiki pambeu dzese dziri panyika. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Asi ikajariwa, painodzomera inokura kukunda zvimwe zvirimwa zvese zviri mudimbamo, inotoita zvimatayi zvirefu zvokutoti tushiri tunotogara makaremo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Adovanyairira nomifananidzo idowanda inenge iyoyi zvichienderana nomanzvitsitsiro yavo. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Hapanai chaadovanyepa chisinai mufananidzo. Waidzoti kana wava wega novadzidzi vache waivatsanangurira zvese.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodekhadza Duthu noGungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Ruka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mauro yozuva rakarero adovanyepa achiti, “Mbatiyambukirei kumhiri kurimwe divi.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Nokudaro vadosiya gurusvusvu rovanhu, ndokuenda naye nokamwadiya sezvaanga ari, panga pano tumwewo tumwadiya twanga turi papfupi naye. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Zvino duthu rikuru ridomuka, mapfeni yomvura yadothanga kupinda mukamwadiya, zvokuti kanga kaakutozara. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Asi iye wanga adoenzera, adotsamira pamutsago kumasure kwokamwadiya. Ipopo vadomumutsa vachiti, “Mudzidzisi, hamunai hanya nai kuti taakupfa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Iye adomuka ndokubva wadzuma duthu, ndokukaruza gungwa achiti, “Dekhadzika urose!” Ipopo duthu ridomira, ndokubva kwadekhara. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Adobva wati kwavari, “Indava yei muchicha zvidodai, hamunai kutenda nai?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ipopo vadocha zvidokungudza ndokubva, vanyairirana vachiti, “Anga munhu wakareyu mbani, anototeerehwa noduthu nogungwa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume anoMweya Udoipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Ruka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Zvino vadosvika kumhiri kwogungwa munyika yovaGarasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jesu paadobirika mukamwadiya, adokumana nomunhu wanga adogahwa nomweya udoipa <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />murume wakareyo waigara mumakuwa. Hapanai wanga achakona kumusunga, kana nongetani chaidzo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Kazinji waisungiwa nongetani manja nomakumbo, asi waidzigwata dzese. Hapanai munhu wanga anosimba rokumudekhadza. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Waigara mumakomo nomumanda masikati nousiku, achikuwa nokuzvisvurungunda nomabhwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Paadondoona Jesu ari kurefu adomumhanyira ndokuwira pasi pamberi pache. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Adokuwa nodzinga ropamusoro achiti, “Chii chamunoda kwandiri, Jesu Mwanakomana waMwari Wokumusorosoro? Ndinokukumbiritsai muzita raMwari kuti mureke kundidzudza.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ndava Jesu wanga wati kushave, “Birika maari, iwe mweya udoipa!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Jesu adomubvunza achiti, “Zita rako ndiwe yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Iye ndokuti, “Rigiyoni, ndava tidowanditsa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Mweya udoipa udokumbira Jesu kuti areke kuidzinga munyika yakareyo.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Zvino papfupi nopakarepo panga pano boka rikuru rohumba dzanga dzichifura mumhera mogomo. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Saka mweya idoipa idomukumbira ichiti, “Tiendesei kuhumba idzo mutisiye tichipinda madziri.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Iye adoibvumira. Ipopo mweya idoipa idobirika ndokupinda muhumba dzaitosvika zviuru zviiri. Dzidotizirana kumapiripiri dzichichudumukira mugungwa dzichipfira makaremo.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Anyakabusa vohumbadzo vadobva vatizirafuti vachienda koudza vanga vari muguta nomumisha. Ivo vadobirika vachienda koona zvanga zvaitika. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Vadosvika panga pana Jesu ndokuona murume uye anga adogahwa nomweya idoipa adogarikika, adotosimira, watokohoroka pfungwa, izvozvo zvidovachisa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Vaye vadoona muitikiro wazvene vadovanyepa zvidoitika kumurume wakareyo nokuhumba dzakaredzo.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ivo vadothanga kukumbira Jesu kuti abirike zvache mudunhu ravo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Jesu paadopinda mukamwadiya murume anga ano mweya idoipa adokumbira kuendawo naye.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Zvisinei, Jesu adomurambira, asi adoti kwaari, “Enda kumba kuhama dzako wovaudza zvomutsa waMwari nozvinhu zvikuru zvaakuitira.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Nokudaro murume adobva waenda ndokuthanga kuzivisa vanhu vomuDhikapori, zvaanga waitihwa naJesu. Vese vadoshamisiwa nazvo.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanasikana waJairosi noMukadzi Adobata Mukombero waJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Ruka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Jesu adoyambuka kamu gungwa achidzoka kumhiri, vanhu vazinji vadoungana kwaari panyasi pogungwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Ipopo umwe wovatungamiri vosinagoge waiitiwa Jairosi, paadoona Jesu, adozvikhandira pasi pamberi potsoka dzache. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Adomuteterera achiti, “Mwanasikana wangu waakutoda kupfa. Uyai mumuturike ruoko renyu pamusoro kuti achire.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Ipopo Jesu adoenda naye, vanhu vazinji vadomutevera vachimusvanikidza.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Umwe mukadzi waibirika gazi kwomakore gumi nomairi, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />wanga watambudziwa pakurapiwa kwaaiitiwa non'anga’anga dzidosiyana siyana, nangwesa kwaitova kutaya pfuma yache, pasinai chaimuyamura asi kutoingidzihwa utenda hwache. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Paadonzva nozvaJesu adouya nokumasure ndokubata jasi rache. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ndava adofunga kuti, “Ndikandobata mbacha dzache basi ndinochira.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Kabodzi nokabodzi gazi ridobva ragwata kubirika, achibva wanzva kuti watopora padenda rache. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Pakarepo Jesu adonzvirafuti kuti simba rache rabirika maari, ndokubva wachungunuka mukati mochaunga achiti, “Mbani wabata mbacha dzangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Vadzidzi vache vadoti kwaari, “Murikuona vanhu vazinji vadokusvanikidzai, imimi ndopomoti, ‘Mbani wandibata?’”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Asi Jesu adoramba achinangara nangara kuti aone wanga wamubatayo. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Mukadzi achiziva zvanga zvaitika kwaari adotetemera nokucha ndokuuya achiwira pasi pamberi paJesu achimuudza chokwadi chese. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kwaari, “Mwanasikana kutenda kwako kwakuporesa. Enda zvako norugare, usununguke kubva padambudziko rako.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Achiri kutaura daipo, vamwe vadobva kumba kwomukuru wosinagoge ndokuti, “Mwanasikana wenyu wapfa, muchashupireiko Mudzidzisi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Jesu haanai kuita basa nozvavadotaura, ndokuti kumukuru wosinagoge, “Reka kucha ndotenda basi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ipopo adobvumiraba munhu kumutevera kusara kwaPita, Jakobho naJohwani mwanabiyache. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Paadosvika kumba kwomukuru wosinagoge, adoona vanhu vachirira maundu, nokubvumvurika nokuridza mhere. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Adopinda ndokuti kwavari, “Munoitireiko mhere idodai muchirira? Mwana haanai kupfa asi adoenzera.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Vadomuseka. Asi Iye adovabiritsa vese achitora baba namai vomwana novaadouya navo, ndokupinda navo mukamuri yanga idoradzikiwa mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Adobata ruoko romusikana achimumutsa achiti kwaari, “Tarita kumi,” ndokuti, musikana ndinoti kwauri muka.<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Kabodzi nokabodzi musikana uye ndiye khwakhwanyaku kumuka nokutekairirafuti, ndava wanga watova nomakore gumi nomairi. Vadoshamisiwa nazvo zvokutosaya nochokunyaira chese. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ipopo adovakohomedza achiti damba wamaudza, ndokuvaudza kuti vamupase chokuja.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorambiwa paNazareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Ruka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Jesu adobirika pakarepo achienda kuguta raadokurira, vadzidzi vache vadomutevera. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Zvino pazuva roSabata adothanga kudzidzisa musinagoge. Vazinji vadomunzva vadoshamisika. Vadoti, “Anga iyeyu adowana poi zvinhu zvakarezvi? Uchenjeri hupi ihwohu hwaadopasiwa zvokuti anotoita mabasa makuru yadodai? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Iyeyu muveziba nai, mwanakomana waMariya, mukoma waJakobho, nowaJosefa, nowaJudhasi, nowaSimoni? Kana hanzvadzi dzache tinadzoba ipopano nai?” Vadobva vaita chisembu naye.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Asi Jesu adoti kwavari, “Muporofiti haasaye kukudziwa kusiya kwomunyika yache, nomuhama dzache, nomumba mache basi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Nokudaro haanai kudzoita mabasa yosimba makaremo kusara kwokundoturika maoko pavahwere vashomanana vaadoporesa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Zvino adoshamisika, nokusaya kutenda kwavo. Saka adotenderera muimwe misha achidzidzisa.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotuma Vanogumi Novairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Ruka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Zvino adodaidza vadzidzi gumi novairi ndokuvatuma vairi vairi, adovapasa masimba pamusoro pomweya idoipa. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Adovaraira kuti vareke kutakura chinhu: mazingwa, homwe kana mari muzvikwama zvavo, kusiya kwotsvimbo. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Asi kuti vapfeke shangu, uye vareke kutakura mbacha dzokuchinja. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Pakamu adoti kwavari, “Pamumba pamunenge matambihwa, garai mumba makaremo kusvikira mabirika paguta rakarero. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Pamusha wamunenge musinai kutambihwa, kana mava kubirika kuhumurai pfumbi ropanzvimbo yakareyo ribirike patsoka dzenyu ridzopfakaza richivaroverera.<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Saka vadoenda vachiparidzira vanhu kuti vapinduke. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Vadodzinga mweya idoipa mizinji nokuzora mapfuta vahwere vazinji vachivaporesa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupfa kwaJohwani Muombeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Ruka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mambo Herudhe andipasi paadonzva nozvaJesu, nokuti zita rache ranga rapararira kwese, iye novamwe vadoti, “NdiJohwani Muombeki adopfa wakareyu, wamuka, saka ndiye ari kuita mabasa iyoya yosimba.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Vamwe ndivo vaiti, “NdiEriya,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">vamwewo vachiti, “Anondovawo umwe muporofiti adofanana novokare.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Herudhe adoti, “Neye, ndiJohwani wakareyu wandidogwata musoro, adomuka kamu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ndava Herudhe pachake adotuma mauto kosunga nokuvharira Johwani mutorongo nondava yaHerodhiyasi mukadzi womunin'ina wache Firipi waanga watora. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Sezvo Johwani waigara achiti, “Mukho kuti utore mukadzi womunin'ina wako.<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Izvozvo zvidoita kuti Herodhiyasi aite hwiranhaka naye, zvokutoda kumubaya, asi wanga asingagone. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Nokuti Herudhe waicha Johwani achiziva kuti adorurama pakamu mutsvene, saka waimudzivirira. Herudhe waifarira kumunzva asi zvidodaipo waitenderedzewa musoro nokutaura kwaJohwani.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Padosvika zuva rokuzvahwa kwaHerudhe adoitira mabiko vakuru vohurumende, vakuru vohondo nonzvahwa dzomuGaririya dzairemekedzewa. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Pakarepo mwanasikana waHerodhiyasi adotamba zvidofadza Herudhe novaadokoka vese. Ipopo mambo adoti kumusikana, “Ndikumbire chese chaunoda, ndichakupfupira chakarecho.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Adovimbisa nokupika kuti, “Ndinokupfupira chese chawada kusvika pachidimbu youmambo hwangu!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Nokudaro mwanasikana adoenda kobvunza amaache achiti, “Ndikumbire chii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Ivo ndokuti, “Kumbira musoro waJohwani Muombeki!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Nokamangu adodzokera kuna mambo ndokumukumbira kuti, “Ndipasei pakarepano musoro waJohwani Muombeki!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mambo adosurukihwa nazvo maninge, asi adonyara kuchora chivimbiso chache pamberi povanhu vaadokoka. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Mambo adotuma uto nokamangu kuti riende kogwata musoro waJohwani, uto ridoenda kutorongo ndokubva ragwata musoro waJohwani, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />nokuuya nawo uri mumbenge uchibva wapasiwa kumusikana, iye adobva waenda kopasa amaache. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Vadzidzi vaJohwani pavadozvinzva vadouya vachitora chitunha chache vachichiviga muguwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anopasa Zvokuja Vanhu Zviuru Zvishano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Ruka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Johwani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Zvino nhumwa dzidodzoka ndokuungana pana Jesu dzichimunyepa zvese zvadzidoita nozvadzidodzidzisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ukuwo gurusvusvu rovanhu raimbondouya nokuenda zvokuti Jesu novadzidzi vache vadotosaya nonguwa yokuja chaiyo. Ipopo Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mbatibirikei paruzinji tiende pedu tega mumbofemawo kanguwa kapfupi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Saka vadodzokwira mukamwadiya vachienda kwavo vega.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Asi vanhu vazinji vadovaona vachienda, futi vadovaziva, saka vadotizirana notsoka vachibva mumaguta yadosiyana siyana ndokuthangira Jesu kusvika. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Jesu paadoburuka mukamwadiya adoona gurusvusvu rikuru rovanhu, achibva avanzvira tsitsi nokuti vaiita kunge hwai dzisinai nyakabusa. Saka adothanga kuvadzidzisa zvinhu zvizinji. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Kudzoti kwava kudoka, vadzidzi vadouya kwaari vachiti, “Kwadoka, apa tichiri musango. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Chiendesai vanhu kumaguta nokumisha vazvitengere zvokuja, vaje.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Asi Iye adovapindura achiti, “Vapasei imimi zvokuja zvacho.” Ivo vadoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">“Toenda chere kotenga mazingwa yomadhenari mazana mairi kuti vaje?” (Dhinari ribodzi wanga uri muhoro wozuva ribodzi).<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Munomazingwa manganiko? Endai konangara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Pavadonangara vadoti, “Tinomazingwa mashano nohove dziiri.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ipopo Jesu adoudza vanhu kuti vagarikike pasi pausva hunyoro vadoita zvikwata zvikwata. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Saka vadogarikika vadoti apa makumi mashano apa zana. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ipopo Jesu adotora mazingwa mashano nohove dziiri, ndokunangara kudzuru ndokuzvikomborera. Adobva wazvikomora komora achipasa vadzidzi vache kuti vapase vanhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Vese vadoja vachiguta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Pakarepo vadohwenga zvimepfu zvomazingwa zvidosara ndokuzaza tsvanda gumi nodziiri nohovewo kamu. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Vanhu vadoja vacho vaipfuura zviuru zvishano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotekaira Pamusoro poMvura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Johwani 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Nokamangu Jesu adosukumidzira vadzidzi vache kupinda mukamwadiya kuti vaende kumhiri kwogungwa kuBhetisaidha, Iye achisara achikototsa vanhu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Wabva mukuvakototsa adokwira mugomo konamata. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Kwasvipa Jesu wanga ari wega panyika, kamwadiya kari pakati pogungwa. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Adovaona vachikikiritsana nokamwadiya, ndava duthu ranga richihwisana navo. Mambakwedza pakati ponguwa yochitatu noyochitanhatu adouya kwavari, achitekaira pamusoro pomvura. Waakutoda kuvapindirira, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />vadobva vamuona achitekaira pamusoro pomvura mugungwa, vachifunga kuti nyhipoko, vadoibongomora mhere. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ndava vese vamuona futi vadobva vabatiwa nokucha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Asi nokamangu adonyaira navo achiti, “Dekharikai, ndini, rekai zvenyu kucha.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Pakarepo adokwira mukamwadiya mavanga vari, duthu ridobva raroserafuti, ipopo vadoshamisika zvidokungudza. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ndava kubva pamunana wokuposhewa kwovanhu zviuru zvishano nozvingwa zvishano, vanga vasinati vanzvitsitsa kuti Iye mbani. Mwoyo yavo yanga yava mikukutu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Vahwere paGenesareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Vadoyambuka kumhiri ndokusvika panyika yoGenasareti ndokusungirira kamwadiya. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Pavadobirika mukamwadiya, pakarepo vanhu vadoziva Jesu, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />ndokutizirana dunhu rese vachitakura vahwere pamibhedha yavo vachienda kwavadonzva kuti ndokwaari. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kwese kwaaienda mumaguta kana mumisha, vairadzika vahwere munzira, vachikumbira kuti vabate mukombero wojasi rache, uye vese vadoubata vadopora.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Tsika dzoMadziteteguru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />VaFarisi novanyori vanga vabva kuJerusarema vadoungana paanga ari, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />pavadoona kuti vamwe vadzidzi vake vanga vachija mazingwa nomanja yanotsambwa, kureva yasinai kushambiwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Nokuti vaFarisi novaJudha vese, vanojaba vasati vashamba maoko yavo, kuri kuchengetedza tsika dzovakuru vavo vokare. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Pese pavanenge vabva kumusika wokutengesera, vanojaba kana vasati vashamba. Iyoyi njimwe yotsika dzavadobatirira padziri, dzidoita sekusuka makomichi, zvirongo nondiro nomidziyo yondarira.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Saka vaFarisi novanyori vadomubvunza, “Indava yei vadzidzi venyu vasingatevere tsika dzovakuru vedu vokare? Nokuti vanoja zvokuja nomanja yanotsambwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Jesu adovapindura kuti, “Imipa vanyengeri, Isaya waireva vakaremi paadoporofita achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Vanhu vova vanondikudza nomiromo yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">asi mwoyo yavo iri kurefu nainini.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Vanondinamata zvomabhwodo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">vachitsinhanisa mitemo yaMwari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">nodzidziso dzidoumbiwa novanhu.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Mudosiya mitemo yaMwari chaiyo muchibatirira kutsika dzovanhu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Adoti kwavari, “Muno uchenjeri hwokuramba mitemo yaMwari muchida kuchengeta tsika dzenyu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Nokuti Mozisi adoti, ‘Kudza baba namai, futi wese anoita zvidobookera kuna baba vache kana kuna maache mbaapunziwe apfe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Manje imipa munoti kana munhu akati kuna baba vache kana amaache, ‘Chinhu chandanga ndichida kukuyamurai nacho chava kobhani,’ kureva kuti chava chipo kuna Mwari. <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Munenge matomurambidza kuyamura baba vache namaache. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Nomutoo wakareyu munosaisa simba Shoko raMwari kuitira kuti muchengetedze tsika dzenyu nozvimwewo zvidodai zvamunoita.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvinhu Zvinosvipisa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ipopo adodaidza vanhu vese ndokuti kwavari, “Nditetekerei mese munzvitsitse: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Hapanai chinopinda mumunhu chichibva kunze chinomusvipisa, asi zvinobuda kubva maari ndizvo zvinomusvipisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />“Anonzeve mbaatetekere anzve.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ndima yakarei haipo muGiriki</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Paadobirika pagurusvusvu rovanhu, achipinda mumba, vadzidzi vache vadomubvunza pamusoro pomufananidzo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ipopo adovabvunza, “Nemiwo munonzvitsitsaba nai? Ko hamuone kuti hapanai chiri kunze chinopinda mumunhu chingamusvipise? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ndava chinopindaba mumwoyo mache, asi chinondopinda mumimba mache, chichibirika pakare.” (Nokunyaira kwakareko Jesu adoonesa kuti zvokuja zvese zvidochena).<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Adoti, “Zvinobirika mumunhu ndizvo zvinomusvipisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ndava kubva mukati momwoyo womunhu munobirika: mifungo idoipa, upombwe, kuba, nokubayana, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />nhafu, kunyangadza, kunyengedza, nokusazvibata, usvinu, kushora, kuzvikudza, noudzemwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Zvidoipa zvakarezvi zvese zvinobirika mukati momunhu ndizvo zvinomusvipisa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda kwoUmwe Mukadzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Wabva pakarepo adoenda kudunhu roTire noSidhoni ndokupinda mumba asingade kuti vamuzive, asi haanai kugona kuhwanda. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Pakarepo paiva nomukadzi wanga ano mwanasikana wanga adogahwa nomweya udoipa. Paadondonzva nozvaJesu adobva wauya kwaari ndokuzviwisira pamberi pache. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mukadzi wakareyo waiva muGiriki, adozvarihwa muFonisiya guta roSiriya. Adoteterera Jesu kuti adzinge mweya udoipa pamwanasikana wache. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Ndinofanira kuthanga ndajisa vana, ndava zvinokodzeraba kutora mazingwa yovana uchiposha tuhanda.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Iye adopindura kuti, “Hinde Ishe, kana notuhanda pasi potafura tunojawo mupfupfunyungwe womazingwa yovana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Jesu ndokuti kwaari, “Nondava yomapinduriro yakareyo, chienda zvako mweya udoipa wabirika pamwanasikana wako.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Mukadzi adoenda kumba ndokuwana mwanasikana wache adoenzera pamubhedha, mweya udoipa wabirika paari.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Burunzeve riri Chimumumu Kamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Zvino Jesu adobva mudunhu roTire achipinda nomuSidhoni ndokusvika pagungwa roGaririya mukati modunhu roDhikaporisi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ipopo vadomuvigira murume wanga ari burunzeve asingagone kutaura vachimuteterera kuti amuturike ruoko pamusoro. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Jesu adomubiritsa pagurusvusvu rovanhu kwake wega ndokumufindikira tukumo munzeve, achibva wasvipa mathe achibata karimi kochimumumu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Adonangara kudzuru ndokuthura chiya achiti kwaari, “Efata,” kureva kuti, “Dziuka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Kabodzi nokabodzi nzeve dzache dzidodziuka, karimi kache kadopfuduka ndokuthanga kutaura mushemushe. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Jesu adovatsindikira kuti vareke kuudza ani zvache, asi paaivatsindikira kuti vazvinyarare ndipo pavaitonyanya kumbondozvishambadzira. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Vanhu vadoshamisika zvidonyanyitsa. Pakushamisika kwavo vadonyaira vachiti, “Zvaanoita zvese zvidonakitsitsa, anodziura nzeve dzoburunzeve nokupfudura karimi kuti chimumumu chigone kunyaira!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoposha Vanhu Zviuru Zvinai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Pamazuva yakareyo padoita futi gurusvusvu rikuru rovanhu ridoungana, futi vanga vasinai chokuja, adodaidza vadzidzi vache ndokuti kwavari, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ndinonzva tsitsi nogurusvusvu rovanhu ava nokuti ndava navo kwomazuva matatu, apa havachinai chokuja. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Kana ndikavadzotsa kudzimba vanonzara vanokomoka munzira ndava vamwe vavo vanobva kurefu zvidonyanya.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Asi vadzidzi vache vadomupindura, “Anga munhu angawane poi musango muno zvinogutsa vanhu veseva?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Iye ndokuvabvunza, “Munomazingwa manganiko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Ivo ndokuti, “Manomwe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ipopo adoudza vanhu kuti vagarikike, ndokubva watora mazingwa manomwe yaye, ndokutenda, ndokuyakomora komora achiyapasa vadzidzi vache kuti vakovanise vanhu, ivo ndokuvakovanisa. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Vanga vano tuhovewo tushomashoma, paadokomborera, adovaudza kamu kuti vakovanise vanhu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Vadoja vachiguta. Vadodzounganidza zvimepfu zvidosara ndokuzaza matengu manomwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Vadoja vacho vanga vari varume vanosvika zviuru zvinai, ndokubva wavaendesa. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Nokamangu vadopindirafuti mukamwadiya ndokuenda kudunhu roDharumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">VaFarisi Vanokumbira Munana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mateo 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Ipopo vaFarisi vadouya kudzopikisana naye nokumuedza vachipopera kuti avaitire chiratidzo chinobva kudenga. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Jesu adothura befu pamweya wache zvidonyanya ndokuti, “Seiko vanhu vanasi vachiruvira kuona chiratidzo? Chokwadi ndinoti musevedzi, hapanai chiratidzo chichapasiwa vanhu vakareva vanasi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Adovasiya ndokupinda mukamwadiya achiyambuka kumhiri.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiriso yovaFarisi noyaHerudhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Vadzidzi vadokangamwa kutakura mazingwa zvokuti mukamwadiya makaremo manga mudondova nozingwa ribodzi. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ipopo adovachenjedza achiti, “Chenjererai mbiriso yovaFarisi noyaHerudhe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Vadonyairirana vachiti, “Ari kudaro ndava tasiya mazingwa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Manje Jesu adoziva zvavainyairirana ndokuti, “Anga zvomazingwa zvamaakunyairirana nzvei kamu? Asi munoonaba nai nomwoyo yenyu yatoti kukutu kuoma nai? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Munotadza nei kuona imi muno meso? Munotadza nei kunzva, imi nzeve munadzo? Ko hamuchayeuka nai? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Pandidokomora paye mazingwa mashano kupasa zviuru zvishano, mudounganidza muchizaza matengu mangani yozvimepfu zvidosara?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Vadoti kwaari, “Gumi nomairi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Ko mazingwa manomwe pazviuru zvinai, matengu mangani yadozara zvimepfu zvamudounganidza?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Ivo ndokuti, “Yadosvika manomwe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Zvino Iye ndokuti kwavari, “Saka munotadza tini kunzvitsitsa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Murume Rombe paBhetisaidha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Zvino vadodzosvika paBhetisaidha, ipopo vadouya norombe kuna Jesu ndokukumbira kuti amubate. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Iye adobata rombe racho ruoko achibirika naro pamusha, ndopaadorisvipira mathe mumaziso. Adobata meso yache ndokumubvunza “Chii chauri kuona?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Adonangara nangara ndokubva wati ndiri kuona vanhu vachitekaira vadoita kunge miti.<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ipopo Jesu adobata kamu meso yomurumeyo, meso yache yadobva yapora ndokuona mushe mushe. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Adomuendesa kumba kwache achimutsindikira, “Reka kana kupinda mumusha.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anozivisa Kuti Jesu Mbani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Ruka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Jesu novadzidzi vache adobirika achienda kumaguta yokuKhesariya Firipi. Vari munzira, adobvunza vadzidzi vache, “Ko vanhu vanoti ndini yani?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Vadopindura kuti, “Johwani Muombeki, vamwe vanoti, Eriya, vamwewo ndivo vanoti muri umwe wovaporofiti.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Iye adoti kwavari, “Ko imipa munoti ndini yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pita adopindura kuti, “Ndimi Khirisitu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ipopo adovatsindikira kuti vareke kunyepa munhu nozvake.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Zvokutambudzika nozvoIpfa Yache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Ruka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Pakarepo Jesu adothanga kuvadzidzisa kuti Mwanakomana woMunhu achatambudziwa chaizvo futi acharambiwa novakuru, novaphirisita vakuru novanyori. Vachamubaya, asi kwapera mazuva matatu achamuka kamu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Izvozvo adozvinyaira asingasvisve. Pita adobva wamutora pache wega ndokuthanga kumudzumidza. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Asi Jesu adochununguka ndokunangara vadzidzi vache, achibva wadzuma Pita achiti, “Ibva kwandiri Sathani! Nokuti unofungaba zvaMwari, unondofunga zvovanhu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Zvino adodaidza gurusvusvu rovanhu novadzidzi vache kuti vauye kwaari, ndokuti, “Wese anoda kunditevera mbaazvirambe atore muchinjikwa wache anditevere. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Nokuti wese anoda kuchidza upenyu hwache achataikihwa nahwo, asi wese anotaikihwa noupenyu hwache nokuda kwangu nokwovhangeri achahuchidza. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Anga munhu akawana nyika yese achitaikihwa noupenyu hwache anenge wawanei? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Chii munhu chaangapereke kutsiva mweya wache nacho? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Nokuti wese anondinyara inini nomashoko yangu muvanhu vanasi vadoipa, vanosanganisa, Mwanakomana woMunhu paachauya muukuru hwaBaba vache, nongirozi dzache dzitsvene, achamunyarawo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Zvino Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chokwadi panovamwe vadomira pano vasiri kudzopfa vasati vaona Umambo hwaMwari huchiuya nosimba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusanduka KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Ruka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Kudzoti kwapera mazuva matanhatu Jesu adotora Pita, Jakobho naJohwani vari vega, ndokukwira navo mugomo rirefurefu, vadomunangara daipo, adosanduka. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Mbacha dzache dzidochena zvokutothoya, zvokuti hapanai muwachi pasi pano anosvika padodaropo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ipopo Eriya naMozisi vadooneka vachinyaira naJesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Zvino Pita adobva wati, “Mudzidzisi, zvidonaka kuti tive pano. Regai tivakhe misakasira mitatu: umwe wenyu, umwe waMozisi, umwe waEriya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ndava wanga achazivaba zvokutaura, ndava vanga vabatiwa nokucha kukuru.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Pakarepo guti ridouya ndokuvafukidza, izvi ridobva muguti richiti, “Wakareyu ndiye Mwanakomana wangu wandinoditsitsa, mutetekerei.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Pasinai nonhambwe yese pavadonangara nangara, hapanai wavadodzoona kusiya kwaJesu naivo basi.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Pavanga voburuka mugomo adovatsindikira kuti vareke kuwana wavanoudza zvavanga vaona kusvikira Mwanakomana woMunhu wamuka kuvadopfa.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ivo vadorambawo vadozvisvisva asi vachimbobvunzana vega kuti kumuka kuvadopfa kunorevei. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Vadomubvunza vachiti, “Seiko vanyori vachiti Eriya ndiye anofanira kuthanga kuuya?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Adopindura kuti, “Ichokwadi kuti Eriya ndiye anothanga kuuya achidzotsera zvinhu zvese. Asi zvidonyohwawo sei kuti Mwanakomana woMunhu achatambudziwa chaizvo nokurambiwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Asi ndinoti kwamuri Eriya adotouya kare, futi vadotomuitira zvavaida kuita naye semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa pamusoro pache.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporesa Mukomana Anga Ano Pfavi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Ruka 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Paadosvika panga pano vamwe vadzidzi adowana gurusvusvu rovanhu rikuru ridovaunganira, novanyori vachipikisana navo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Nokamangu vanhu pavadondoona Jesu vadoshamisika ndokutizirana kwaari vachimumoresa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Iye adovabvunza, “Muri kuvabvunzeiko?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Umwe pakati pogurusvusvu adoti, “Mudzidzisi, ndauya kwamuri nomwanakomana wangu anoitisiwa chimumumu noshave. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Pese parinomubata rinomuphomorera pasi, wopupuma furu kumuromo achitsenganisa mazino wobva waoma muviri. Ndakumbira vadzidzi venyu kuti vadzinge shavero, manje varitadzirira.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Imi, vanhu vanasi vasinai nokutenda kwese, ndichava nemi kusvikira rini? Ndichava nomwoyo murefu nemi kusvikira riniko? Uyai naye kuno.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ivo vadoenda naye kuna Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Mweya udoipa paudondomuona, udomugwinhagwinha ndokumuphomorera pasi uchimuumburudza, achipupuma furu kumuromo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Ipopo Jesu adobvunza baba vache, “Adobva rini adodai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Ivo ndokuti, “Kubva paudiki hwache. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kazinji unomuwisira mumoto, kana mumvura kuti umubaye, asi kana pano zvamunokwanisa kuita, tinzvirei tsitsi mutiyamure.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Kana uchitenda, zvese zvinogoneka kuno anotenda.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Nokamangu baba vomwana vadodaidzira, “Ndinotenda, kana pane pandiri kutsakidza, ndiyamurei.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Jesu paadoona kuti mhomho yovanhu yaakutizirana kwaari, adodzuma mweya udoipa achiti, “Iwe mweya wouchimumumu nouburunzeve, birikirafuti ureke kudzopinda maari kamu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ipopo mweya udokuwa uchimugwinhagwinha zvidoipitsitsazvo uchibva wabirika maari. Iye ndokuita kunge wapfa zvokutoti vazinji vadototi wapfa. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Asi Jesu adomubata ruoko achimumutsa, achibva wasumuka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Kudzoti Jesu wapinda mumba, vadzidzi vache vadomubvunza pavo vega, “Sei tatadzirira kuudzinga?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mushoo uyu unobirika chete nomunamato.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonyaira Kamu zvoIpfa Yache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mateo 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Ruka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Jesu adobirika pakarepo ndokupinda nomuGaririya pakare waidaba kuti zvizikane nomunhu, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Adodzidzisa vadzidzi kuti, “Mwanakomana woMunhu achaisiwa mumaoko yovanhu, ivo vachamubaya, kana vamubaya achamuka kamu kwapera mazuva matatu.<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Asi ivo vadonzvitsitsaba zvaadonyaira, futi vaicha kumubvunza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbani Mukuru muUshe Hwokudenga?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Ruka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Kudzoti vasvika Kaperenaume, vapinda mumba, adovabvunza kuti, “Manga muchipikisanei munzira?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Hapanai chavadomupindura, ndava munzira vaiitirana nharo dzokuti mbani mukuru. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Adogarikika pasi ndokudaidza vanogumi novairi achiti kwavari, “Kana munhu achida kuva wokuthanga, wakareyo mbaave wokupedzisira pavese, ave muranda wovese.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Pakarepo adotora mwana mudiki ndokumumisa pamberi pavo, adomutakura mumaoko yache ndokuti kwavari, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Wese anotambira mwana anenge iyeyu muzita rangu, anenge wanditambira inini. Nowese anonditambira inini, anotambiraba inini basi, asi anotambirawo noadondituma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asingapesani Nesu Ngwedu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49">Ruka 9:49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Zvino Johwani adoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, taona munhu asingafambe nesu achidzinga mweya idoipa muzita renyu, manje tamurambidza nokuti ngweduba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Asi Jesu adoti, “Regai kumurambidza, nokuti hapanai munhu angaite munana muzita rangu achidzopusihwa nokamangu kutaura zvidoipa pamusoro pangu. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ndava asingapikisane nesu ngwedu wakareyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ndava wese anokupasai mukombe womvura muzita rangu kuti mumwe nokuti muri vaKhirisitu, chokwadi ndinokunyepai kuti anosayaba mubairo.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miedzo yokuti Utadze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Ruka 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Wese anokonzera umwe wovadiki vadodaiva vanotenda kwandiri kutaya kutenda kwache kwandiri, hasa kutoti guyo rikuru risungirihwe muhuro mache, akhandiwe mugungwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Kana ruoko rako richikukonzera kutadza, rigwate! Hasa kupinda muupenyu udoremara panokupinda mugehena mumoto usingadzimwe unomaoko yese. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />(Muno honye isingapfe nomoto usingadzimwe). <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Kana tsoka yako ichikutadzisa, igwate. Zviri nani kuwana upenyu husingapere unotsoka ibodzi panokupinda muGehena mumoto usingadzimwe unotsoka dzese. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />(Muno honye isingapfe, nomoto usingadzimwe). <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Futi kana ziso rako richikukonzera kutadza ritokonore! Hasa kuti upinde muumambo hwaMwari unoziso ribodzi panokukhandihwa mugehena unomaziso mairi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Muno honye isingapfe nomoto usingadzimwe.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Nokuti munhu wese acharungiwa nomoto.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mwinyu udonaka, asi kana wataya kuvava kwawene kuchadzotsehwa tini?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">Ivai nomwinyu mamuri, muve norugare pakati penyu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Kuroorana Nokurambana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Ruka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Wabva pakarepo adoenda mudunhu roJudhiya, nokumhiri kwaJorodhani. Gurusvusvu rovanhu ridouya kamu kwaari. Iye adovadzidzisa semaitiro yaaiita nguwa dzese.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Vamwe vaFarisi vadouya kudzomuedza vachibva vamubvunza, “Tiudze, zviri pamutemo chere kuti munhu arambe mukadzi wache?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Adovapindura achiti, “Ko Mozisi adokurairai chii?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Vadoti, “Mozisi adobvumira kuti murume apase mukadzi gupuro womuendesa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Ipopo Jesu adovapindura kuti, “Kwaitova kuoma mwoyo kwenyu saka adokunyorerai mutemo udodaroyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Asi kubva pakusikiwa, Mwari adovaita murume nomukadzi. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Nochikonzero chakarecho murume achasiya baba vache namaache (anamatirane nomukadzi wache). <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Vairi vakarevo vachava nyama ibodzi. Saka vanenge vachiriba vairi asi nyama ibodzi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Saka chabatanidziwa naMwari mbaparege kudzova nomunhu anochikwachanura.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Vapinda mumba, vadzidzi vache vadomubvunza kamu pamusoro ponyaya yakareyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Adoti kwavari, “Wese anoramba mukadzi wache achiroora umwe anomuitira upombwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Futi mukadzi akaramba murume wache woroorewa noumwe, anoita uhure.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoropafadza Vana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Ruka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Zvino vanhu vadoti vachiuya novana vadiki kuna Jesu kuti avabate, vadzidzi vache vadovatsiura. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Jesu paadozviona haanai kufara nazvo ndokubva wati kwavari, “Siyai vana vadiki vauye kwandiri, regai kuvarambidza nokuti umambo hwokudenga ngwavo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ndinokuudzai chokwadi, wese asingatambire umambo hwaMwari semwana mudiki, anopindaba mahuri. <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Adovabata mumaoko yache achiturika maoko yache pavari.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jaha Ridopfuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Ruka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Adoti wabirika waakutoenda, pano adoenda kwaari achitizira ndokupfugama pamberi pache achibvunza, “Mudzidzisi adonaka, chii chandingaite kuti ndigare nhaka youpenyu husingapere?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Sei uchinditi adonaka? Hapanai adonaka kunze kwaMwari. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Mirairo unoiziva inoti, ‘Reka kubaya, reka kuita upombwe, reka kuba, reka kuita upfakazi hwomabhwodo, reka kubiridzira, kudza baba vako namaako.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Iye adoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, zvese zvakarezvi ndidozvichengeta kubva paudiki hwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Ipopo Jesu adomunangara achibva wamuda, ndokuti kwaari, “Wasarihwa nochibodzi, enda wotengesa zvaunazvo zvese, wopasa varombo, ipopo unenge wava nopfuma kudenga, wouya wonditevera.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Jaha paridonzva zvakarezvo ridododoma kaso richibva raenda nochitsvumwoyo ndava ranga rinopfuma idowanditsa.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jesu adonangara nangara ndokuti kuvadzidzi vache, “Zvichaomera sei vapfumi kupinda muumambo hwaMwari!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Vadzidzi vache vadoshamisiwa chaizvo nomashoko yache. Asi Jesu adovapindura kamu achiti kwavari, “Vana, muomero rini wazvidoita kupinda muumambo waMwari! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Zvidotopusira ngamera kupinda nopaboo ronariti pamupfumi kuti apinde muumambo hwaMwari.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Vadoshamisiwa zvidopindiridza ndokutaurirana vachiti, “Manje mbani anoponesewa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Zvino Jesu adovanangara ndokuti, “Kuvanhu, zvinokwanisikaba, asi naMwari zvinokwanisika.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ipopo Pita adoti kwaari, “Onai, tidosiya zvese tichikuteverai.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Chokwadi ndinokunyepai, hapanai munhu adosiya imba kana vana kana vakoma novanin'ina’ina kana hanzvadzi kana minda nokuda kwangu kana kwovhangeri, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />asingadzotambira zvidopetewa kazana zvino, muupenyu hwakarehuno, dzimba, vakoma novanin'ina’ina, hanzvadzi, anamai, vana, minda nokutambudziwa, uye munyika ichauya achava noupenyu husingapere. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Asi vazinji vari vokuthanga vachava vokupedzisira, novokupedzisira vachava vokuthanga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kochitatu Jesu Anonyaira Zvokupfa Nokumuka Kwache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Ruka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Pavanga vaamunzira vachikwidza kuenda kuJerusarema, Jesu wanga adovatungamira, vadzidzi vaishamisika, futi vaimutevera vachicha. Adotora vanogumi novairi parutivi ndokuvanyepa zvanga zvichadzoitika kwaari, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />achiti, “Onai, tirikuenda kuJerusarema, Mwanakomana woMunhu achaisiwa kuvaprista vakuru, nokuvanyori, ivo vachamutongera ipfa, vomuisa kuvanhu vasiri vaIzirairi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Ivo vachamuseka nokumuzvidza, vachamurova nokumusvipira mathe, vomubaya, asi musure momazuva matatu achamuka kamu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anoda Kuva Mukuru Mbaave Muranda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ipopo vanakomana vaZebhedhiya, Jakobho naJohwani, vadonyedza kwaari vachiti, “Mudzidzisi, tinoda kuti mutiitire chese chatinokukumbirai.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Adoti kwavari, “Munoda kuti ndikuitirei chii?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Vadoti kwaari, “Itai kuti pamunogara mukubhwinya kwenyu mutiise umwe kuruji kwenyu umwe kurubose kwenyu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Asi Jesu adoti kwavari, “Munozivaba zvamunokumbira, munogona nai iyemi kumwa mukombe womatambudziko wandinomwa inini? Nokuombekewa noruombeko randinoombekewa inini?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ivo vadoti, “Tinogona,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">“Jesu adobva wati kwavari, “Muchamwa zvenyu mukombe wandichamwa, nokuombekewa ruombeko randichaombekewa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Asi zvokugara kuruji kwangu nokumamose kwangu nzvanguba kuti ndizvipase munhu, asi nzvoavo vadozvigadzirihwa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Vanogumi pavadozvinzva, vadomwamwira Jakobho naJohwani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ipopo Jesu adovadaidza ndokuti kwaari, “Munoziva kuti vaye vanotohwa sevatongi vodzimwe Ndudzi, vanoremedza vari pasi pavo, novakuru vavo vanoita chisimba kwavari. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Manje izvozvo ndizvoba zvazvinofanira kuva pakati penyu, wese achava mukuru pakati penyu anofanira kushandira abiyache. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Noanoda kuva wokuthanga pakati penyu, achava muranda wovese. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Nokuti naiyewo Mwanakomana woMunhu haanai kuuya kudzoshumihwa asi kudzoshumira nokupasa upenyu hwache kuti ruve rudzikinuro rovazinji.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusvinudziwa kwaBhatimeyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Ruka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Zvino vadosvika paJeriko, paanga waakubirika novadzidzi vache nogurusvusvu rovanhu, parutivi ponzira yakareyo panga padogarikika rombe raiitiwa Bhatimeyo mwanakomana waTimeyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ipopo adonzva kuti ndiJesu woNazareta, ndokuthanga kudaidzira achiti, “Jesu, Mwanakomana waDhavhiti ndinzvirei tsitsi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Vazinji vadomudzuma vachimunyepa kuti anyarare, asi iye adobva wasokokerafuti kuramba achidaidzira achiti, “Mwanakomana waDhavhiti, ndinzvirei tsitsi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Nokudaro Jesu adomira ndokuraira kuti adaidziwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Ivo vadodaidza rombe vachiti, “Tsunga, ari kukudaidza, chitosumuka uende.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Adokutukudza bhachi rake kudodaro ukwo, ndokuvhurumuka kusumuka achienda kuna Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Chii chaunoda kuti ndikuitire?” Rombe ridoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">“Mudzidzisi ndinoda kuti ndione.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jesu adoti kwaari, “Kutenda kwako kwakuporesa, chienda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Kabodzi nokabodzi adoona, ndokumutevera munziramo.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Anopinda muJerusarema Achipemberehwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Ruka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Johwani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Pavanga vaakuda kusvika muJerusarema vava paBhetifegi noBhetaniya paGomo roMiorivhi, Jesu adotuma vadzidzi vache vairi. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Adoti kwavari, “Endai mumusha wamudonangarana nawo, mukapinda makaremo munoona kamwana koburu kadosungirihwa kasati kambogadhiwa nomunhu, kasugudurei muuye nako. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Kana paita anokubvunzai kuti, ‘Muri kukasugudurirei?’ Mupindurei kuti, ‘Ishe vari kukada, ipopo achakatumira pano tsotsono.’”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ivo vadoenda ndokuwana kamwana koburu kunze kwomusuo, kadosungirihwa panzira sezvavanga vanyepewa naJesu, ndokukasugudura. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Vadobvunziwa novanhu vanga vadomira pakarepo vachivati, “Muri kusudugurirei kaburu kakareko?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ivo ndokupindura sezvavadoudziwa naJesu, vachibva vavarega vachienda. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Vadouya nako kuna Jesu, ndokubva vawaridza hembe dzavo pamusoro pakene, ndokubva iye wakagadha. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Vanhu vazinji vadowaridza hembe dzavo, vamwe vachitema mazani yomiti vachimuwaridzira mumugwagwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Vanga vadotungamira novaitevera mumasure vaidaidzira vachiti, “Hozana! Adokomborehwa iye anouya muzita raIshe. <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Hudokomborehwa umambo huri kuuya hwababa vedu Dhavhiti, Hozana kumusorosoro!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Zvino adosvika muJerusarema, ndokupinda muchivanze choimba yaMwari, ndokunangaranangara achiona zvinhu zvese. Sezvo kwakanga kwadoka, adobirika ndokuenda kuBhetaniya novanogumi novairi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukuyu Wanga Usingabereke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18">Mateo 21:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Fume mangwana vaakubva kuBhetaniya, Jesu wanga waanonzara. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ari kurefu adoona mukuyu wanga uno mazani, adoenda koona kana uno muchero. Paadosvika pauri, hapanai chaadowana asi mazani yega yega, nokuti nguwa yohuyu yanga isinati yasvika. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kumuti wakareyo, “Mbaparegerefuti kuva nomunhu anoja michero pauri.” Paadotaura zvakarezvo vadzidzi vache vadozvinzva.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anodzinga Vaitengeserana muimba yaMwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Ruka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Johwani 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Pavadosvika muJerusarema Jesu adopinda muchivanze choimba yaMwari, ndokuthanga kudzinga vaitengeserana muimba yaMwari, nokupidigura mathafura notumipando tovaitsinhana mari, novaitengesa njiva. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Futi adobvumiraba kuti pave noanotakura chinhu achipinda nomuimba yaMwari. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Asi adodzidzisa vanhu achiti, “Mumagwaro mudonyohwa kuti ‘imba yaMwari yangu ichanzi imba yokunamatira yomarudzi yese’ asi imimi matoiita bako romakororo.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Vaphirisita vakuru novanyori pavadonzva zvakarezvo, vadothanga kutsvaga nzira yavangamubaye nayo, asi vaimucha ndava vanhu vese vanga vashamisiwa nokudzidzisa kwache.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Kudzoti yava mauro vadobirika muguta.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simba Rokutenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateo 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Mangwanani yomusi udotevera, pavaipfuura vadoona mukuyu uye waoma nomidzi yese. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pita adokumbuka ndokuti kwaari, “Onai muti wamudoshurikidza uye waoma.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jesu adovapindura achiti, “Ivai nokutenda muna Mwari. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, munhu upi zvache anoti kugomo iri ‘Birika uende kombwerera mugungwa, asingatsakidze mumwoyo make, asi achitenda kuti zvaataura zvichaitika, zvinoitika sekutaura kwache. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Nokudaro ndinoti kwamuri, chese chamunoda mukachinamatira nokutenda kuti matochitambira, muchachiwana. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Futi pese paunonamata, kana pano adokutadzira, muregerere kuitira kuti Baba vako vokudenga vakuregererewo zvitadzo zvako.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Asi kana musingaregerere, naBaba venyu vokudenga havakuregererewo zvitadzo zvenyu.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanopikisa Simba raJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Ruka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Adopinda kamu muJerusarema. Paanga achitekaira muchivanze choimba yaMwari, vaphirisita vakuru novanyori novakuru vovanhu vadouya kwaari. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Vadoti kwaari, “Mbukuru hwai hwaunahwo hwokuita zvinhu zvakarezvi? Noadokupasa ukuru hwakareho, mbani?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jesu adovapindura kuti, “Ini ndichakubvunzaiwo mubvunzo mubodzi, mukandipindura, neniwo ndichakuudzai ukuru hwandinahwo hwokuita zvinhu zvakarezvi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Ko ruombeko raJohwani rudobva kudenga chere kana kuvanhu? Pindurai.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Vadothanga kupikisana vachiti, “Kana tikati kudenga, Iye achati, ‘Zvino mudoregerei kumutenda?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Kana tikati, ‘Rudobva kuvanhu,’ tinocha vanhu nokuti vese vaitenda chaizvo kuti Johwani waiva muporofiti.” <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Vadodzoti kuna Jesu, “Tinozivaba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jesu adoti kwavari, “Neniwo ndinokuudzaiba ukuru hwandinahwo hwokuita zvinhu zvakarezvi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mufananidzo Wovarimi Vadoipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Ruka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ipopo Jesu adothanga kunyaira kwavari nomufananidzo achiti, “Umwe murume adosima miti yomizambiringa mumunda mache, ndokuusosera, achibva wachera gomba rokusvinira muto, ndokuvakha chirindo, zvino adousiira vashandi achibva waenda kunyika iri kurefu. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Nguwa yokukohwa paidosvika, adotuma muranda wache kuvashandi kuti vamupase michero yomunda. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ivo vadomubata ndokumurova ndokumuendesa asinai chinhu. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Adotuma kamu umwe muranda kwavari. Vadomurova musoro, nokumubata uyanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Adotuma umwe kamu, uyu vadomubaya. Novamwe vazinji vaadotuma, ivovo vaivarova kana kuvabaya. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Kusvikira wasarihwa nomwanakomana mubodzi waaiditsitsa wokutuma, Adotuma wakareyo ari wokupedzisira, achigurupira kuti, ‘Vacharemekedza mwanakomana wangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Asi vashandi vakarevo vadorangana vachiti, ‘Uyu ndiye muji wonhaka, mbatimubayei, kuti nhaka isare yava yedu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Vadomubata, ndokumubaya, vachimukhandidzira kunze kwomunda womizambiringa.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Chii chichaitiwa nomwenekachiro womunda? Achauya achibaya vashandi vakarevo, wopasa vamwe munda wache. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Hamunai kuverenga gwaro rakareri nai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Ibhwe ridorambiwa novavakhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">ndiro ridodzova musoro wokhona.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Izvi zvidoitiwa naIshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">zvinoshamisa mumaziso yedu!’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ipopo vadozimbwa kuti wataura mufananidzo wakareyo achireva ivo. Saka vadotsvaga mabatiro yavangamuite asi vadocha vanhu, ndokubva vamusiya, vachienda zvavo.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukudziwa kwaMwari nokwoVatongi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Ruka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Zvino vadodzotuma vamwe vovaFarisi novokwaHerudhe kumuteya kubva pamashoko yache. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ivo vadouya vakati kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, tinoziva kuti muri pachokwadi hamusanduriwe nomunhu, ndava hamuverenge kuti munhu mbani. Asi munodzidzisa vanhu chokwadi chaMwari chaicho. Zviri pamutemo chere kuti tiripe mitero kuna Khesari kana kurega?<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Tipereke chere kana tiregedze?” Asi Iye nokuziva unyengeri hwavo adoti, “Sei muchida kunditeya? Ndipasei dhinari ndirione.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Vadouya naro kwaari, iye ndokuti kwavari, “Chiso nomunembo wakareyu nzvaani?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Ivo vadoti kwaari, “NzvaKesari.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kwavari, “Saka pasaika Khesari, zvaKesari, mopasawo Mwari zvaMwari.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Vadobva vashamisiwa naye.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuroorana Pakumuka kwoVadopfa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Ruka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Zvino padodzouyawo vaSadhusi vanoti hakunai kumuka kwovadopfa, ndokumubvunza vachiti, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mudzidzisi, Mozisi adotinyorera kuti, ‘Kana munhu akapfa achisiya mukadzi wache asinai mwana, munin'ina womupfi mbaatore mukadziyo kuti aberekere mukoma wache vana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Zvino panga panovanakomana vanomwe, wokuthanga adoroora ndokupfa achisiya mukadzi asinai mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Wochipiri adomugara nhaka, iyewo adopfa achisiya kamu mukadzi asinai mwana, wochitatu adoitawo zvibodzi bodzizvo. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Zvidoitika nzvokuti vese vari vanomwe vadopfa pasinai adosiya adoita mwana nomukadzi wakareyo. Pakupedzisira mukadzi adodzopfawo. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Sezvo mudzimai wakareyu adova mukadzi wovarume vese vari vanomwe, pakumuka kwovadopfa achadzova mukadzi waani?” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chakarechi ndichoba nai chikonzero chamuri kutaika nacho, chokusaya kuziva Magwaro pabodzi nosimba raMwari? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Nokuti pakumuka kwovadopfa, havaroore kana kuroodzewa, asi vanenge vaita kunge ngirozi dziri kudenga. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Zvino panyaya yokumuka kwovadopfa, hamuna kuverenga nai mubhuku raMozisi paadonyora zvidotauhwa naMwari padzambwa achiti, ‘Ndini Mwari waAbhurahamu, naMwari waIsaki, naMwari waJakobho?’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Saka haasi Mwari wovadopfa asi ndiMwari wovapenyu, ipopo muri kutaikitsa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutemo Mukuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Ruka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Zvino umwe wovanyori waivawo pakarepo paadonzva kunetsana kwavaiita, adoona kuti Jesu wapindura vaSadhusi zvidonaka, adomubvunzawo achiti, “Ngupi mutemo wokuthanga panoyese?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Wokuthanga nguyu, ‘Inzva Izirairi, Ishe Mwari wedu ndiye Ishe mubodzi, <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Futi unofanira kuda Ishe Mwari wako nomwoyo wako wese, nomweya wako wese, nokufunga kwako kwese, nosimba rako rese.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Wochipiri nguyu, ‘Unofanira kuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita.’ Hapanai umwe murairo unokurira yakarei.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ipopo munyori adoti, “Mudzidzisi zvamanyaira nzvochokwadi, ndava kuna Mwari mubodzi, hakunai umwe kunze kwache. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Nokumuda nomwoyo wese nokunzvitsitsa kwese nosimba rese, nokuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita. Izvozvi zvinokunda zvipiriso zvese zvinopisiwa nozvibairo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Jesu paadoona kuti wapindura zvidochenjera, adoti kwaari, “Hausi kurefu noumambo hwaMwari.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kubva ipopo hapanai futi adodzotsunga kumubvunza mubvunzo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anga Khirisitu Mwanakomana waDhavhiti Chere?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Ruka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Zvino Jesu paaidzidzisa ari muimba yaMwari adoti, “Seiko vadzidzisi vomurairo vachiti Khirisitu Mwanakomana waDhavhiti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dhavhiti pachake adotaura ari muMweya Mutsvene achiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Ishe adoti kuna Ishe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Garikika kuruji kwangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">dzamara ndaisa vavengi vako pasi potsoka dzako.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Zvino kana Dhavhiti pachake achimudaidza kuti Ishe, anodzova mwanakomana wache tini?” Chaunga chidofara kumunzva.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anovachenjedza Pamusoro Povanyori</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Ruka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Pakudzidzisa kwache adoti kwavari, “Chenjererai vanyori vanofarira kuthadzvaira vadosimira majasi marefu, nokumoresewa vachiremekedzewa novanhu munzvimbo dzinokumana vanhu vazinji. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Vanoda kamu kugara pazvigaro zvopamusoro mumasinagoge, nopamabiko vachida kupiwa nzvimbo dzovanhu vanoremekedzewa. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Vanonyepera kuita minamato mirefu vari mudzimba dzovajiche vachidzovabiridzira.” Kurangiwa kwavo kuchava kukuru.<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chipo Chikuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Ruka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Jesu paanga adogarikika padonangarana nochivigiro chomari, adoona mapasihwo yaiitiwa mari novanhu. Vapfumi vazinji vaipereka mari idowanda. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Padodzouyawo mujiche murombo ndokukhandawo tumari tudikidiki tuiri tunokwana sendi. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ipopo adodaidza vadzidzi vache akati kwavari, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri mujiche murombo uyu wapereka zvidowanda kukunda vese vaisa muchivigiro. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Nokuti vamwe vese vapereka vachibiritsa kubva pazvizinji zvavanazvo. Asi iye pakusaya kwache wapereka zvese zvaanga anazvo, zvaifanira kumuraramisa.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Zviratidzo Zvomazuva Yokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Mateo 24:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Ruka 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Zvino paanga achibirika muimba yaMwari, umwe mudzidzi wache adoti kwaari, “Mudzidzisi, nangarai muone kushamisa kwomabwe nozvivakwa zviri pano.”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jesu adomudaira achiti, “Muri kuona chere zvivakhwa izvi zvikuru zvoimba yaMwari? Hapanai dombo richasara riri pamusoro porimwe risinai kukoromohwa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhamu Nokutambudziwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Ruka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Paanga wagarikika pagomo roMiorivhi padonangarana noimba yaMwari, Pita, Jakobho, Johwani naAndireya vadouya kwaari pavo vega ndokumubvunza, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tinyepei, ndirini pachaitika zvinhu zvakarezvi, pachava nochiratidzo chei chokuti zvaakuda kuitika?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Chenjerai kuti mureke kutsambutsiwa nomunhu. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Vazinji vachauya muzita rangu vachiti, ‘Ndini Khirisitu,’ vachitsambutsa vazinji. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Muchanzva zvohondo nomarehwarehwa yohondo, regai kuvhunduka nokuti zvakarezvo zvinofanira kuitika, asi kuguma kunenge kusinati kwasvika. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Nyika dzichapandukirana, noumambo huchamukirana, pachava nokugwetedzeka kwonyika munzvimbo dzizinji, pachava nonzara. Kwakareku kuchava kuthanga kwonhamu asi kuguma kunenge kusati kwasvika.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Zvichenjererei nokuti vachakukwirirai kumatare, nokukurovai mumasinagoge. Muchamisiwa pamberi pomadzimambo novatongi nokuda kwangu kuti huve upfakazi kwavari. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Nyaya Idonaka inofanira kuthanga yaparidzihwa marudzi yese. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Kana maendesewa kudare, regai kunetseka kuti muchanyairei. Panokwana nguwa yacho ndotaurai zvamunopasiwa. Ndava mashoko yamunonyaira njenyuba, yanobva kuna Mweya Mutsvene. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mukoma nomunin'ina vachabayisana, baba nomwana wavo. Novana vachamukira vabereki vachivabayisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Muchazondewa novanhu vese nokuda kwangu, asi anochiirira kusvika pakuguma achaponesewa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zvidonyangara Zvinochisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Ruka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Asi kana moona nyangadzi honzeri yotsambwa (anoverenga mbaacherechedze). Vari muJudhiya mbavatizire kumakomo. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Ari pamusoro poimba yache mbaarege kuburuka achipinda mumba kuti awane chaangabiritse. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Naiyewo ari kumunda mbaarege kudzoka kumba kudzotora chokusimira. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Asi pamazuva yakareyo zvichanyanya kunyangarira vanomimba novanomwisa! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Namatai kuti zvireke kuitika panguwa yomhepo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Nokuti pamazuva yakareyo pachaita matambudziko yasinai kumboitika kubva pakusikiwa kwonyika naMwari kusvika zvino, futi yanodzoitikaba kamu. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Dai Ishe vaireka kutapudza mazuva yakareyo, hapanai waichira, asi nokuda kwovasaruhwa vache mazuva yakareyo yachatapudziwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Zvino kana munhu akati kwamuri, ‘Onai, Khirisitu ari pano kana kuti onai ari uko,’ regai kuzvitenda. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Nokuti anaKhirisitu vomabhwodo novaporofiti vomabhwodo vachamuka vachiita zviratidzo nozvishamiso kuti kana zvichikwanisika vatsambutse novasaruhwa vacho. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Asi chenjerai nokuti ndagara ndakuudzai zvese zvisati zvaitika.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudzoka kwaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Ruka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Mumazuva yakareyo, mumasure mokutambudzika, zuva richadzimwa, mwedzi uchatadza kuvhenekera, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Nyenyedzi dzichambwera kubva kudenga, masimba yokudenga yachagwetedzeka. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Ipopo vanhu vachaona Mwanakomana woMunhu achiuya ari mumakuti nomasimba makuru nokubhwinya. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Achatuma ngirozi dzache kuti dziunganidze vasaruhwa vache kubva kumativi manai yonyika, kubva kumheramhera kwonyika kusvika kumheramhera kwodenga.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudzidza Kubva Pamukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Ruka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Zvino dzidzai pamukuyu kana mathai yawene yaakuthungira mazani matsva, munoziva kuti mainza yaakusvika. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ndomwenze daro kana maakuona zviitiko zvakarezvi zvathanga kuitika, zivai kuti kudzoka kwache kwava papfupi, pamusuwo chaipo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Chokwadi, ndinoti kwamuri vanhu vonguwa yakarei havapfi vese zvisati zvathanga kuitika. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Denga nonyika zvichapfuura asi mashoko yangu yanopfuuraba.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hapanai Anoziva Zuva kana Nguwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Asi kana riri zuva nonguwa yakareyo inoziviwaba nomunhu, kana ngirozi dzokudenga, kana Mwanakomana, asi Baba vega. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Chenjerai, murindire, ndava hamuzive kuti nguwa inosvika rini. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Zvidofanana nomunhu adoenda hwendo hurefu. Anosiya wapasa vashandi vache mabasa yokuita, ndokuudza murindiri wopamusuwo kuti agaririre. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Rambai mudondogaririra nokuti nguwa inodzoka mwenekachiro womusha munoizivaba, pangave pakati pousiku, mukanganyama kana mangwanani. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kuti areke kundoyerekana wasvika achikuwanai mudoenzera hope. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Zvandinokunyairirai imimi ndinoudza vese: Garirirai!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Vanorangana Kubaya Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Ruka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Johwani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Kwandosara mazuva mairi yokusvika kwomabiko yoPhasika noyoMazingwa Yasinai Mbiriso, vaphirisita vakuru novanyori vadotsvaga mazano yadohwanda yokusunga nokubaya nayo Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Asi vadoti, “Mbazvirege kuitiwa pamutambo woMazingwa Yasinai Mbiriso kuti vanhu vareke kudzoita bongozozo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozodzewa paBhetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Johwani 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Jesu ari paBhetani, mumba maSimoni womabobo, paanga adotsveyamira pathafura yokuja kwomauro, padouya umwe mukadzi wanga anoguchu romapfuta yanodhura yonadhi chaiyo. Adoyavhura ndokuyadururira mumusoro waJesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ipopo vamwe vadotsva mwoyo nazvo ndokuti, “Ko mapfuta iyoya yachenekehwei? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Handiti yaitogona kutengesewa nomadhinari mazana matatu mariyo yokovehwa kuvarombo?” Vadobva vamukaruza noukari.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Asi Jesu adoti, “Siyanai naye, seiko muchimunetsa? Waita basa ridonaka kwandiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Varombo munavo nguwa dzese, pamunenge mandoda munovaitira zvidonaka, asi inini handisi nemi nguwa dzese. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Waita zvaagona, wafana kuzora muviri wangu kuitira zuva rokuvigiwa kwangu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, kwese kuchaparidziwa Nyaya Idonaka munyika dzese, zvaaita zvichanyaihwa achikumbukiwa nazvo.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judhasi Anopandukira Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Ruka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Zvino Judhasi Sikariyoti umwe wovanogumi novairi adoenda kuvaprista vakuru kuti aise Jesu kwavari. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ivo vadofara kunzva zvakarezvo ndokuvimbisa kumupasa mari. Nokudaro iye adotsvaga mukana udofanira wokumupandukira nawo.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoja Phasika Novadzidzi Vache</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Ruka 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Johwani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Pazuva rokuthanga roMazingwa Yasinai Mbiriso riri zuva raibayiwa hwayana yoPhasika, vadzidzi vache vadomubvunza, “Nghupi kwamunoda kuti tiende kokugadzirirai kuti mujire Phasika?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Iye adotuma vadzidzi vache vairi achiti kwavari, “Pindai muguta, makaremo muchasangana nomurume adotakura chirongo chomvura. Muteverei wakareyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Taurai nomwenekachiro woimba yaachapinda muchiti, ‘Mudzidzisi wati, njipi imba yovarendo yandichajira zingwa roPhasika risinai mbiriso ndinovadzidzi vangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Iye achakunangidzai imba ikuru yomuturikidzwa idorongedzewa nokugadzihwa, tigadzirirei makaremo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Vadzidzi vadoenda, ndokupinda muguta, vachiwana zvidoita fanike matauriro yaanga waita kwavari. Ivo ndokugadzira chirairo choPhasika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Yava mauro, Jesu adosvika novanogumi novairi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Vari pathafura pakuja, Jesu adoti, “Chokwadi ndinoti kwamuri, umwe wenyu achandipandukira, wandiri kutoja naye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Vadosuwa nazvo, ndokuthanga kumubvunza mubodzi mubodzi vachiti, “Kuti ndini?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Adoti kwavari, “Nguyo umwe wovanogumi novairi wandiri kuseva pabodzi naye mumbenge.” <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Nokuti Mwanakomana woMunhu achaenda sezvidonyohwa pamusoro pache, asi mayanga kumunhu wakareyo anomupandukira! Zvanga zviri hasa kumunhu wakareyo dai asinai kuzvariwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chirairo chaIshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Ruka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 vaKorinde 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Vari pakuja daipo Jesu adotora zingwa achiriropafadza. Adorikomora komora achiripasa vadzidzi vache achiti, “Torai, uyu muviri wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Adotora mukombe, ndokutenda, adovapasa vachimwa vese pauri. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Adoti kwavari, “Aya magazi yangu yochibvumirano yanoteurihwa vazinji. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Chokwadi ndinokuudzai kuti ndichamwaba kamu muto womazambiringa kusvikira zuva iro randinozoumwa wava mutsva muumambo hwaMwari.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Pavadoimba chimbo vadobirika vachienda kugomo romiOrivhi.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anoporofita Kuramba kwaPita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Ruka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Johwani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Ipopo Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mese muchandisiya usiku huno, nokuti kudonyohwa kuti, ‘Ndicharova nyakabusa, ipopo hwai dzichapamwara.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Asi pandichamuka ndichakutangirai kuenda kuGaririya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pita adoti kwaari, “Kunyange vese vakakusiyai, inipano ndinokusiyaiba.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Chokwadi ndinokunyepa, nasi uchandiramba katatu, usiku ihwohuno, jongwe risati rarira kairi.<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Asi iye adotsikimidza achiti, “Handipfe ndakurambai, kana zvikatotora kupfa nemi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Vamwe vese vadotaurawo daro.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anonamata muGetsimani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Ruka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Vadosvika panzvimbo inoitiwa Getsimani, Iye ndokuti kuvadzidzi vache, “Garai pano, ini ndichinamata.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Adotora Pita, Jakobho naJohwani. Ipopo adothanga kutambudzika zvikuru nokuremehwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Zvino adoti kwavari, “Mwoyo wangu udosuwitsa, zvokusvika paipfa, rambai muri pano, mudogaririra.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Adoenda kurefu pashoma ndokupfugama achinamata kuti dai zvaikwanisika nguwa yakareyo yamupindirira. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Zvino adoti, “Baba vangu, zvinhu zvese zvinokwanisika kwamuri, biritsai mukombe wakareyu kwandiri. Mbakurege kuva kuda kwangu asi kuda kwenyu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Paadodzoka, adovawana vaenzera, ndokuti kuna Pita, “Simoni, watoenzera? Watadza kugaririra awa ibodzi? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Garirirai muchinamata kuti mureke kupinda pamuedzo. Mweya unoda zvawene asi nyama idoneta.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Adoenda pakamu achinamata achitaura mashoko mabodzi bodziyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Paadodzoka pakare, adovawana vaenzera kamu ndava meso yavo yanga yabatiwa nohope zvokutotadza kupenya, futi vadosaya kuti vomupindura kuti chii.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Adodzoka kochitatu ndokuti kwavari, “Muchidoenzera nokuzorora? Zvakwana, nguwa yasvika, Mwanakomana woMunhu wapandukihwa achiisiwa mumaoko yovatadzi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Sumukai tiende, onai nyakundipandukira wava papfupi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusungiwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Ruka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Johwani 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Pasinai nonhambwe yese, achiri kunyaira daro, Judhasi umwe wovanogumi novairi adosvika nogurusvusvu rovanhu vanga vadopakata mapakatwa nomatemo, vachibva kuvaprista vakuru, novanyori, novakuru vovanhu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Nyakumupandukira wanga wavapasa chiratidzo, achiti, “Uyo wandichatsvoda ndiye wacho, musungei muende naye mudomuchengetedza.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Paadosvika adobva waenda paari achiti, “Tenzi!” achimutsvoda. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ivo vadobata Jesu ndokumusunga. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Zvino umwe wovanga vadomira pakarepo adomworora bakatwa ndokutema muranda womuphirisita achibva wamugwata nzeve. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Jesu adoti kwavari, “Mauya kondipamba nai muno mapakatwa nomatemo, kunge muri kuhwisa gananga? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Inga ndaidzidzisa muimba yaMwari mazuva yese muripo asi musingandibati, saka regai Magwaro yazazisiwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ipopo vadzidzi vese vadotiza vachimusiya.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Pavadomusunga, rimwe jaha ridomutevera riri pedzi, ridondozvimonerera biza basi, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ridosiya biza ndokutiza riri takwatakwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Pamberi poDare Rovapirisita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Ruka 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Johwani 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Ipopo vadoenda naJesu kumukuru wovaphirisita kwanga kudoungana vaphirisita vakuru, vakuru vovanhu, novanyori. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pita adomutevera ari kurefu, adotosvika pachivanze chomuphirisita mukuru, ndokugarikika achiwotha moto pabodzi novachengetedzi. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Zvino vaphirisita vakuru nodare rese vadotsvaga pfakazi dzaizonenera Jesu mhosva yoipfa, asi hapanai wavadowana. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Vazinji vadopa upfakazi vachimunenera zvomabhwodo, asi upfakazi hwavo hwaipesana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Vamwe vadodzosumuka vachipa upfakazi hwomabhwodo, vachiti, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Tidomunzva achiti, ‘Ndichapwanya imba yaMwari yakarei idovakhiwa nomaoko, ndoita imwe mumazuva matatu, isinai kuvakhiwa nomaoko.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Asi zvidodaro, upfakazi hwavo hahunai kuwirirana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Muphirisita mukuru adosumuka pamberi podare achibvunza Jesu, “Haupindure nai? Chiiko ichi chavanokupomera?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Asi adoramba adondonyarara, haanai chaadopindura. muphirisita mukuru adomubvunza pakare, “Ndiwe chere Khirisitu Mwanakomana woAdokomborehwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jesu adomupindura achiti, “Ndini, uye uchaona Mwanakomana woMunhu adogarikika kuruoko roruji roMasimba, achiburuka nomakuti kubva kudenga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ipopo muphirisita mukuru adokerura hembe dzache achiti, “Tichadireiko pfakazi? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Manzva kushora Mwari kwaaita. Munoti chii nazvo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Vese vadomutongera mhosva yoipfa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Vamwe vadothanga kumusvipira mathe, vachimuvhara chiso, nokumurova vachiti, “Porofita kuti mbani wakurova!” Varindi vadomutambira ndokumukhanda zvibhagera.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Anoramba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Ruka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Johwani 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pita achiri pazasi paaigotha moto muchivanze, murandakadzi womuphirisita mukuru adouyawo pakarepo, <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Paadoona Pita adogotha moto, adomunangaritsa ndokuti, “Naiwewe wanga una Jesu, muNazarini.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Asi iye adozviramba achiti, “Zvaunonyaira ndinozvizivaba, kana kuzvinzvitsitsa.” Adobirika pakarepo achienda padonangana nopasuwo rikuru. Ipopo jongwe ridorira.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Murandakadzi adomuona, ndokuthanga pakare kunyaira kuno vanga vadomira achiti, “Murume wakareyu mabiyavo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Iye adoramba pakamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Kwapera kanguwa, vanga vadomira pakarepo vadoti kamu kuna Pita, “Chokwadi iwewe uri mabiyavo, ndava uri woGaririya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Asi adothanga kuzvishurikidza achipika, achiti, “Ndinomuzivaba munhu wakareyu wamunoreva.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Pakarepo jongwe ridorira kochipiri. Pita adobva wayeuka zvidotauhwa naJesu kwaari, “Jongwe risati rarira kairi uchandiramba katatu.” Paadozvifunga adoiboora mhere achirira,<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Pamberi paPondiyasi Pirato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mateo 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Ruka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Johwani 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Mangwanani ngwanani, vaphirisita vakuru, novakuru vovanhu, vanyori nodare rese vadoungana vachirangana zvokuita, ipopo vadosunga Jesu vachimuendesa kuna Pirato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Zvino Pirato adomubvunza, “Ndiwe chere mambo wovaJudha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Iye adopindura achiti, “Ndozvawareva,”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Vaphirisita vakuru vadomunenedzera zvidowanda. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Ipopo Pirato adomubvunza pakare achiti, “Naiwe, unopinduraba? Ona mawandiro yomhosva dzavanokunenera.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Asi Jesu adoramba adonyarara. Zvakarezvo zvidoshamisa Pirato.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anotongehwa Kupfa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Ruka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Johwani 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Zvino pamabiko waimbosunungura musungwa mubodzi anenge wakumbihwa novanhu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Panga panoumwe mupanduki mutorongo waiitiwa Bharabhasi wanga anomhosva yokubaya munhu pabongozozo raadomutsa naabiyake. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Ipopo gurusvusvu ridouya ndokuthanga kukumbira Pirato kuti aite zvaanombovaitira. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Iye adovapindura achiti, “Munoda chere kuti ndikusunungurirei mambo wovaJudha?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Nokuti adoziva kuti vaphirisita vakuru vanga vapereka Jesu kwaari nondava yochanje.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Asi vaphirisita vakuru vadofurira gurusvusvu kuti Pirato avasunungurire Bharabhasi panzvimbo yaJesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pakare Pirato adoti kwavari, “Saka ndoita tini naye munhu wakareyu wamunoti mambo wovaJudha?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ivo vadodaidzira pakare, “Mbaarovehwe.”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Zvino Pirato adoti kwavari, “Nondava yei, adotadzei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Asi ivo vadodaidziritsa vachiti, “Mbaarovehwe.”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Saka nokuda kugutsa ruzinji, Pirato adosunungura Bharabhasi, ndokurova Jesu, achimuendesa korovehwa pamuchinjikwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mauto Yanodadira Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Johwani 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Zvino mauto yadoenda naye mukati momuzinda womutongi (munoitiwa piritoriamu), vadounganidza boka ravo rese. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Vadomusimidza jasi ritsvuku, ndokuruka chiremba chominzva vachimudzika mumusoro. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Vadothanga kumumoresa vachiti, “Moroi, Mambo wovaJudha.” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Vadomurova mumusoro notsanga, vachimusvipira mathe, nokumupfugamira zvomusese. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Pavadopedza kumudadira vadomukatanura jasi ritsvuku, vachimusimidza zvipfeko zvache. Vadobva vaenda naye komuroverera.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anorovehwa Pamuchinjikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Ruka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Johwani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Zvino vadosukumidza Simoni wokuSairini Sairini, baba vaErekizanda naRufasi waizvifambirawo achibva kumusha, kuti atakure muchinjikwa waJesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Zvino vadoenda naye panzvimbo inoitiwa Gorogota zvinoreva kuti nzvimbo yodehenya. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ipopo vadomupasa waini idokumanisiwa nomura, asi iye adoimwaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Vadomurovera pamuchinjikwa, vachibva vakamuranisa hembe dzache, ndokukhanda hakata kuti vaone kuti mbani achawana hembe ipi yacho. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Yanga yava awa yochitatu, pavadomurovera pamuchinjikwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Chinyohwa chomhosva yache chaiti, “MAMBO WOVAJUDHA.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Vadorovera mbavha dziiri pabodzi naJesu, imwe kuruji, imwe kurubose kwake. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ipopo Gwaro ridozazisiwa rinoti, “Adoverengehwa pabodzi novanyangadzi.” (ndima yakarei haiwanike muzvinyohwa zvokare).<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Vaipinda nopakarepo vadomumbombodzera vachikwetekwedza misoro yavo vachiti, “Aa! Ndiweka wokuda kupwanya imba yaMwari uchidzoivaka mumazuva matatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />chiburukaka pamuchinjikwa, uzviponese.”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Novaphirisita vakuru novanyori, vadomudadira vachiti, “Waindosimbira kuponesa abiyache, asi iye asingagone kuzviponesa nai! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Taakuda kuona Khirisitu Mambo wovaIzirairi achiburuka zvino pamuchinjikwa, kuti titende kwaari.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Vanga vadorovehwa pabodzi naye naivowo vadomutukirira.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupfa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Ruka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Johwani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Paawa yochitanhatu, rima ridofukidza nyika yese kusvikira paawa yochipfemba. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Paawa yochipfemba Jesu adodaidzira noruzha, “Eroi, Eroi, ramasabhakatani?” Zvinoreva kuti, “Mwari wangu, Mwari wangu, mandisiireiko?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Vamwe vanga vadomira pakarepo pavadozvinzva vadoti, “Inzvai, ari kudaidza Eriya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Umwe adomhanya ndokuzaza chipanje novhiniga, adochijungirira patsanga achimupasa kuti amwe, achiti, “Mirai tione kana Eriya achiuya kudzomuburutsa.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Jesu adodaidzira noruzha achibva wapfa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ipopo jira romuimba yaMwari ridokeruka nopakati kubva kumusoro richidzika pasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Zvino mukuru wozana wanga adomira adonangarana naye, paadonzva kudaidzira kwache nokuona mapfiro yache, adoti, “Chokwadi murume uyu wanga ari Mwanakomana waMwari.”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Vamwe vakadzi vaizviona vadomira kurefu. Pakati pavo panga pana Mariya Magadharina, naMariya mai vaJakobho mudiki kuna Josesi, naSaromi, <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />ndivo vakadzi vaimutevera paanga ari kuGaririya vachimutenairira novamwewo vakadzi vazinji vadouya naye kuJerusarema.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvigiwa kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Ruka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Johwani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Yanga yava mauro, sezvo ranga riri zuva roGadziriro, ndokuti, zuva rinotangira Sabata, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Josefa woAramatiya wanga ari nhengo inoremekedzewa mudare rikuru rovaJudha, ariwo munhu wanga adomirira umambo hwaMwari, adoita chivindi chokuenda kuna Pirato achikumbira chitunha chaJesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pirato adoshamisika kuti wanga watopfa kare, achibva wadaidza mukuru wozana waadobvunza kana Jesu wanga watopfa kare, <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Mukuru wozana paadosimbisa shoko rokupfa kwache, Pirato adobvumira Josefa kutora chitunha. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Saka Josefa adoburutsa chitunha chaJesu ndokuchiputiridza nofuko raanga watenga. Adochiviga muguwa ridofongewa padombo, achibva warivhara noribhwe rikuru raadokungurutsira pamuromo parene. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mariya Magadharina naMariya mai vaJosesi vanga varipo vachiona paadovigiwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kumuka KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Ruka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Johwani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Sabata paridopera, Mariya Magadharina, naMariya amai vaJakobho, naSaromi, vadotenga zvinonushira, kuti vaende kozora chitunha chaJesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mangwanani ngwanani yozuva rokuthanga rosondo vadoenda kuguwa zuva richandobuda. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Vaibvunzana vachiti, “Mbani achatikungurutsira ibhwe kubva pamuromo woguwa?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Pavadonangara vadoona kuti ibhwe ranga riri rikuru ranga rakungurutsihwa uko. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Pavadopinda muguwa vadoona jaha ridogarikika kurutivi roruji, ridosimira jasi richena, vadobva vashamisika. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Jaha ridoti kwavari, “Rekai kushamisika, handiti muri kutsvaga Jesu woNazareta wanga adorovehwa? Haapo pano wamuka, onai paanga adoradzikiwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Asi endai moudza vadzidzi vache, naPita, kuti vaende kuGaririya, vachamuwana watova kwakareko sekutaura kwaadoita.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ivo vadochisiwa ndokubirika paguwapo vachitiza, nokuti vadoshamisika zvidonyanya. Havanai kugona kuzviudza munhu nokucha kwanga kwavabata.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzvinangidza kwaJesu kuna Mariya Magadharina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Mateo 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Johwani 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Zvino Jesu wamuka kuvadopfa mangwanani yomusi wokuthanga kwosondo, adothanga kuzvinangidza kuna Mariya Magadharina uyo waadobiritsa mweya idoipa minomwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Iye adoenda konyepa vaye vanga vanaye, vaiita maundu nokumurira. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Asi pavadonzva kuti Jesu mupenyu futi kuti iye wanga watomuona, vadozvitendaba.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anozvinangidza Kuvadzidzi Vairi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Ruka 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Mumasure Jesu adozvinangidza noumwe mutoo kuvairi vavo, pavaienda kumusha. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ivo vadodzoka ndokunyepa abiyavo, asi naivova havanai kuvatenda.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumiwa Kukuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Ruka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Johwani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mabasa yoNhumwa 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Pasure Jesu adozvinangidza kuno vanogumi nomubodzi vari pakuja, adovatsiura pamusoro pokusatenda kwavo noukukutu hwomwoyo yavo, nokuti havanai kutenda avo vanga vamuona mumasure mokumuka kwache. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Adoti kwavari, “Endai munyika yese koparidza Nyaya Idonaka kuzvisikwa zvese. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Anotenda achiombekewa anoponesewa, asi asingatende achatongewa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Zviratidzo izvi zvichatevera vanotenda, vachadzinga mweya idoipa muzita rangu, vachanyaira mitauro mitsva. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Vachabata nyoka, kana vakamwa nduru inobaya, ichavakuwadzaba, vachaisa maoko yavo pamusoro povanohwara, vahwerevo vopora.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Anokwira Kudenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Ruka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mabasa yoNhumwa 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ishe Jesu, paadopedza kutaura navo, adotohwa kuenda kudenga, kwaadogara kuruoko raMwari roruji. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Zvino vadzidzi vadoenda koparidza kwese kwese, Ishe adoshanda navo, achisimbisa shoko rache nozviratidzo zvanga zvichitevera shoko. Ameni.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>